    "[夺神权柄]等级+2，[万钧之势]等级+1。": "[Divine Conqueror] Level +2; [Might of Thunder] Level +1.",
    "[夺神权柄]和[军团惩戒]造成的伤害可以触发雷属性额外效果，触发概率基于自身近战武器的触发概率。": "Damage dealt by [Divine Conqueror] and [Legion's Punishment] has a chance to trigger Bonus Effect based on Sibylle's Melee Weapon Trigger Probability.",
