    "[噩梦实验室]爆炸伤害": "[Nightmare Lab]Explosion DMG",
    "[噩梦实验室]持续时间": "[Nightmare Lab]Duration",
    "[噩梦实验室]的移动速度降低效果提高至60%。": "The Movement Speed decrease effect inflicted on enemies in [Nightmare Lab] is increased to 60%.",
    "[噩梦实验室]范围内的敌人移速降低，处于地面上的[小可爱]将暂停延迟爆炸的计时，且不会被其他[小可爱]引爆。\n[噩梦实验室]关闭时会引爆范围内所有的[小可爱]，并对范围内的敌人造成火属性伤害，每引爆1枚[小可爱]，令[噩梦实验室]的伤害倍率提高并为自身回复神智。": "When in the area of [Nightmare Lab]:\nThe Movement Speed of enemies within range is decreased.\nThe detonation timers of [Tot Poppers] on the ground are paused, and they won't be detonated by other [Tot Poppers].\n\nWhen [Nightmare Lab] closes:\nDetonates all [Tot Poppers] within range and the lab explodes to deal Pyro Damage to the enemies within range. For each [Tot Popper] detonated, increases the explosion damage of [Nightmare Lab] and restores Sanity for Yale and Oliver.",
    "[噩梦实验室]每引爆1枚[小可爱]额外伤害倍率": "[Nightmare Lab]Bonus Damage Multiplier per [Tot Popper] Detonated",
    "[噩梦实验室]每引爆1枚[小可爱]神智回复": "[Nightmare Lab]Sanity Recovery per [Tot Popper] Detonated",
    "[噩梦实验室]移动速度降低": "[Nightmare Lab]Movement Speed Decrease",
    "[二重唱]获得[沉浸度]": "[Immersion] Granted by [Duo]",
    "[二重唱]获得的[沉浸度]提高至最大神智的1.5%。": "[Immersion] gained from [Duo] is increased to 1.5% of Max Sanity.",
    "[繁花舞会]等级+2，[群花邀约]等级+1。": "[Blossom Ball] Level +2, [Invitation of Blossoms] Level +1.",
    "[繁花舞会]领域半径": "[Blossom Ball] Radius",
    "[繁花舞会]领域持续期间，全属性穿透提高30%。\n释放[终章]时，如果[花刺]层数不足12层，可立即消耗[重奏]获得对应层数的[花刺]进行补充。\n释放[终章]后，立即触发5次[圆舞]，执行效果时视为带有[重奏]且不消耗[重奏]。": "During [Blossom Ball], PEN stats increase by 30%. When casting [Finale], if [Thorns] is not at 12 stacks, immediately consume an equal number of [Reprise] stacks to make up the difference.\nAfter casting [Finale], immediately trigger [Waltz] 5 times. These triggers are treated as though [Reprise] is active and do not consume [Reprise].",
    "[放射]的触发的间隔降低。": "[Emission] triggers more frequently.",
    "[放射]的触发间隔降低至<Highlight>1.0</>秒。": "Reduces [Emission] cooldown to <Highlight>1.0</>s.",
    "[飞芒]等级+2，[散射]等级+1。": "[Flare] Level +2, [Diffusion] Level +1.",
    "[飞羽逐轻尘]伤害": "[Feathers Chase Dust In Dreams]Damage",
    "[飞羽逐轻尘]伤害半径": "[Feathers Chase Dust In Dreams]Damage Radius",
