    "[飞羽逐轻尘]神智消耗降低": "[Feathers Chase Dust In Dreams] — Sanity Cost Reduction",
    "[风花飞旋]等级+2，[群花邀约]等级+1。": "[Petal Pirouette] Level +2, [Invitation of Blossoms] Level +1.",
    "[伏击]状态中，无法被敌人发现，移动速度提升，受到伤害时不会退出[伏击]状态。": "While [Ambush] is active, Falsi cannot be detected by enemies, gains increased Movement Speed, and does not exit [Ambush] upon taking damage.",
    "[浮光鳞粉]伤害": "[Ethereal Powder] DMG",
    "[浮生多变化]的每点[剑意值][弦意值]收益倍率增加0.7%，自身周围20米内仅有1/2名敌人时，每次造成武器伤害时转化的[剑意值][弦意值]变为3/2点。": "Increases the effect percentage of [Sword Intent]/[String Intent] applied to [Life's A Fleeting, Shifting Tide] by 0.7%.\nWhen there is/are 1/2 enemy/enemies within 20 metres, the mutual conversion point between [Sword Intent] and [String Intent] is increased to 3/2 points when Kezhou deals weapon damage.",
    "[腐草为萤]等级+2，[萤烛微光]等级+1。": "[Fluorescent Eclosion] Level +2; [Amberlight] Level +1.",
    "[腐朽配方]持续时间": "[Decay Formula] Duration",
    "[高温清扫]持续期间，自身全属性穿透提高60%。": "Increases Hilda's PEN stats by 60% during [Pyrolytic Cleaning].",
    "[高温清扫]等级+2，[自动保洁]等级+1。": "[Pyrolytic Cleaning] Level +2; [Automatic Sanitizing] Level +1.",
    "[高温祛污焰束]长度": "[Hyperthermal Purgejet] Length",
    "[高温祛污焰束]长度提高50%，击败敌人时，自身获得造成伤害提高18%效果，持续15秒，最多叠加5层。": "Increases the length of [Hyperthermal Purgejet] by 50%.\nWhen defeating an enemy, Hilda gains 18% DMG Boost for 15s, up to 5 stacks.",
    "[工作热情]每秒下降5点，移动冲撞造成伤害时，回复1点。[蹄蹄大冲撞]技能持续期间，[工作热情]不会下降。当[工作热情]下降至0时，退出骑乘状态并释放1次[蹄蹄小跑]。": "[Passion For Work] loses 5 point per second, and restores 1 when dealing damage upon knocking into a target. During [Trotters Charge-Charge], [Passion For Work] will not lose. When all [Passion For Work] points drop to 0, Truffle dismounts and unleashes [Trotters Trot-Trot] once.",
    "[工作热情]下降速度降低50%。": "Decreases the losing speed of [Passion For Work] by 50%.",
