    "[化身为兽·献奉]额外攻击提高": "[Bestial Fury: Devotion]Bonus ATK Boost",
    "[化身为兽·献奉]额外攻击提高上限": "[Bestial Fury: Devotion]Bonus ATK Boost Cap",
    "[化身为兽·献奉]技能速度提高": "[Bestial Fury: Devotion]Skill SPD Boost",
    "[化身为兽·献奉]每秒沉浸度消耗": "[Bestial Fury: Devotion]Immersion Drain (per sec)",
    "[化身为兽·献奉]状态中，持续消耗[沉浸度]代替持续消耗神智维持[化身为兽]状态，技能速度提高，额外基于自身最大神智，提高自身攻击。\n[化身为兽·献奉]状态中，无法因维持[化身为兽]状态而每秒获得[沉浸度]。": "While under [Bestial Fury: Devotion], continuously drains [Immersion] instead of Sanity to maintain the state. Increases Skill Speed, and boosts ATK based on the user's Max Sanity. \nWhile active, [Bestial Fury: Devotion] prevents [Immersion] gain from sustaining Beast Form.",
    "[化身为兽]每秒获得[沉浸度]": "[Immersion] Granted by [Bestial Fury] per second",
    "[化身为兽]状态中，基于自身最大神智，提高自身攻击。\n自身可通过释放技能获得[沉浸度]，[沉浸度]上限与最大神智相等。释放[宣叙调][咏叹调]时，获得一定量的[沉浸度]；[化身为兽]状态中，每秒获得一定量的[沉浸度]。\n[化身为兽]状态中[沉浸度]达到上限时，自动进入[化身为兽·献奉]状态。": "When in [Bestial Fury] state, increases Attack based on Phantasio's Max Sanity.\nPhantasio gains [Immersion] by using skills, with the [Immersion] cap equal to Phantasio's Max Sanity. Using [Recitativo] or [Aria] gains a certain amount of [Immersion]; when in [Bestial Fury] state, continuously gains [Immersion] per second.\nWhen [Immersion] reaches its maximum in [Bestial Fury] state, Phantasio enters [Bestial Fury: Devotion] state.",
    "[幻象]伤害": "[Phantasm] DMG",
    "[幻象]速度降低": "[Phantasm] SPD Decrease",
    "[幻象]效果半径": "[Phantasm] Effect Radius",
    "[回魂]触发[漆黑之手]的效果时，自身获得20连击点数。": "When [Soul Refrain] causes [Tenebrous Hand] to attack, the caster gains 20 Combo Points.",
    "[回魂]触发[漆黑之手]效果的攻击次数增加至3次。触发效果时，自身获得25%的全属性穿透，持续3秒。": "When [Soul Refrain] causes [Tenebrous Hand] to attack, it attacks 3 times instead. When this occurs, the caster gains 25% PEN stats for 3s.",
    "[回魂]触发[漆黑之手]效果所需的近战普通攻击次数减少至6次。": "[Soul Refrain] now requires only 6 Melee Normal Attacks to cause [Tenebrous Hand] to attack.",
    "[火力压制]持续时间": "[Suppressing Fire] Duration",
    "[火药酬宾]持续期间受到的伤害降低30%，攻击速度提高的叠加间隔降低至0.06秒。": "During [Gunpowder Revelry], reduces Damage Taken by 30%, and decreases the interval of gaining the ATK Speed boost to 0.06s.",
    "[火药酬宾]等级+2，[战术速射]等级+1。": "[Gunpowder Revelry] Level +2; [Tactical Rapid Fire] Level +1.",
    "[火药酬宾]期间使用[汉塞尔与格雷特]触发额外效果时为目标附加[裂伤]，持续8秒。": "During [Gunpowder Revelry], when triggering Bonus Effect using [Hansel and Gretel], inflicts [Laceration] on the target(s) for 8s.",
    "[急板]持续时间": "[Presto] Duration",
    "[急板]额外获得昂扬提高90%效果；触发[二重唱]的获得[沉浸度]效果时，[急板]持续时间延长0.2秒。": "[Presto] grants an additional 90% Morale Increase. When [Duo]'s [Immersion] is triggered, extends [Presto]'s duration by 0.2s.",
    "[急板]技能范围提高": "[Presto] Skill Range Boost",
    "[寂灭]范围提高至6.0米，伤害必定触发额外效果。": "Increases [Oblivion] radius by 6.0 m and its damage is guaranteed to trigger bonus effects.",
    "[歼星模式]等级+2，[蓄势待发]等级+1。": "[Starfall Mode] Level +2, [Poised to Strike] Level +1.",
    "[歼星模式]状态持续期间，[星如雨]每5秒自动进行4次远程攻击并获得8层[蓄势]，不消耗[天工火药]。": "While [Starfall Mode] is active, [Stars Ashower] automatically triggers 4 ranged attacks every 5s and grants 8 stacks of [Momentum]. These attacks do not consume [Artificer Powder].",
    "[剑非剑]攻击范围提高": "[Phanosword] ATK Range Boost",
