    "[剑意值][弦意值]收益倍率": "[Sword Intent]/[String Intent] Effect Percentage",
    "[降灵]最多叠加层数提高至30.0层，每层[降灵]使自身召唤召唤物时，召唤物属性继承比例提高0.25%。\n带有30.0层[降灵]时，额外获得[唤醒]：武器触发概率提高100.0%，[送行挽歌]的伤害倍率增加700.0%，召唤物死亡时，额外触发1次不消耗灾厄值的[送行挽歌]。": "Increases max [Invocation] stacks to 30.0. Each stack increases your Summons' inherited attribute percentage by 0.25%.\nAt 30.0 stacks of [Invocation], additionally gain [Awakening]: Weapon Trigger Probability increases by 100.0%, [Parting Requiem]'s damage multiplier increases by 700.0%, and when a Summon dies, an additional [Parting Requiem] is triggered without consuming Calamity.",
    "[交响]伤害": "[Symphony]DMG",
