    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n队内有2个或以上属性相同的角色时，自身和队友背水提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases Resolve for self and allies if 2 or more characters on the team share the same element.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n队内有2个或以上属性相同的角色时，自身和队友造成的技能伤害提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases Skill DMG for self and allies if 2 or more characters on the team share the same element.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和暗属性队友攻击提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\n Increases ATK for self and Umbro allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和队友暴击率提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\n Increases CRIT Chance for self and allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和队友防御提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\n Increases DEF for self and allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和队友攻击提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\n Increases ATK for self and allies.",
