    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和队友造成的武器伤害提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\n Increases Weapon DMG for self and allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和风属性队友攻击提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases ATK for self and Anemo allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和光属性队友攻击提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases ATK for self and Lumino allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和火属性队友昂扬提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\n Increases Morale for self and Pyro allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和火属性队友攻击提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases ATK for self and Pyro allies.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和精通武器包含单手剑或突击枪的队友造成的武器伤害提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases Weapon DMG for self and allies proficient in Swords or Assault Rifles.",
    "[仅在作为协战同伴登场时生效]\n自身和雷属性队友昂扬提高。": "[Available only when deployed as a Combat Partner]\nIncreases Morale for self and Electro allies.",
