    "[酒红伤]伤害提高30%,[开酒刀]飞行速度增加至25。": "Damage from [Crimson Wound] +30%. [Sommelier's Blades] Launch Speed is increased to 25.",
    "[酒红伤]伤害提高30%,[开酒刀]飞行速度增加至25米/秒。": "Damage from [Crimson Wound] +30%. [Sommelier's Blades] Launch Speed is increased to 25m/s.",
