    "[军团惩戒]每次造成伤害时，20%概率再触发一次。": "When [Legion's Punishment] deals damage, there is a 20% chance to trigger its effect once.",
    "[军团惩戒]伤害": "[Legion's Punishment] DMG",
    "[军团战阵]等级+2，[苍白挽歌]等级+1。": "[Legion Formation] Lv. +2; [The Pale Elegy] Lv. +1.",
    "[开酒刀]持续时间": "[Sommelier's Blade] Duration",
    "[开酒刀]环绕角色飞行时，对路径上的敌人造成伤害。\n[开酒刀]被击飞后，飞行一定距离后返回，往返途中均能对路径上的敌人造成伤害。\n返回途中如果被[猩红欢宴]的攻击命中，将其向周围的随机目标再次击飞。": "While orbiting the character, [Sommelier's Blades] deal damage to enemies in their path.\nWhen launched, they travel a set distance before returning, dealing damage to enemies both on the way out and on the way back.\nIf struck by [Scarlet Banquet] while returning, they are launched again at a random nearby target.",
