    "[流明枝]烛芯累计造成2000000点伤害": "Dealt a total of 2000000 points of damage with [Glowing Branch] lampwicks",
    "[流明种]进化为[流明枝叶]的概率提高至<Highlight>100%</>。": "Increases the chance for a [Lumiseed] to evolve into a [Lumileaf] to <Highlight>100%</>.",
    "[玛尔洁的可燃垃圾箱]残留的灰烬区域，持续时间延长至20秒。": "Extends the duration of the Zealous Zone created by [Margie's Combustible Bin] to 20s.",
