    "[玛尔洁的可燃垃圾箱]造成伤害后，目标受到来自玛尔洁的伤害提高60%，持续5秒。": "When [Margie's Combustible Bin] deals damage, damage dealt to the target from Margie is increased by 60% for 5s.",
