    "[梦笔生花]每层追加伤害倍率": "[Taleweaver Quill]Each Stack's Additional DMG",
    "[梦笔生花]最多叠加层数提高至45层，释放[“在一个暖和的午后”]时额外获得3层[梦笔生花]，[喧闹下午茶]领域持续期间每秒额外获得1层[梦笔生花]。": "Increases max [Taleweaver Quill] stacks to 45. Using [\"On a Warm Afternoon\"] grants 3 additional stacks. While [Boisterous Tea Party] is active, gains 1 extra stack per second.",
