    "[匿踪]持续时间": "[Stealth] Duration",
    "[匿踪]状态中，无法被敌人发现，受到伤害时不会退出[匿踪]状态，发动攻击或释放[猎袭]时主动退出[匿踪]状态。": "When in [Stealth] state, Outsider cannot be detected by enemies, and taking damage will not exit [Stealth].\nLaunching attack or using [Predator's Pounce] will exit [Stealth] state.",
    "[匿踪]状态中，移动速度提高35%。": "When in [Stealth] state, increases Movement Speed by 35%.",
    "[屏障]抵挡投射物吸收其伤害时，对伤害来源附加1层[过劳怨念]，持续3秒，仅此方式可叠加[过劳怨念]，最多叠加2层。": "When [Barrier] absorbs damage from projectiles, inflicts 1 stack of [Overwork Grudge] on the attacker for 3s, up to 2 stacks. [Overwork Grudge] is only stackable in this way.",
    "[破茧]状态中，每5秒发射16枚[浮光鳞粉]；[浮光鳞粉]和[鳞粉印记]造成伤害时，有35%概率在目标处生成1个[幻象]。": "While in [Flamboyance], fires 16 [Ethereal Powder] particles every 5s. When [Ethereal Powder] or [Powder Stigma] deals damage, there is a 35% chance to spawn a [Phantasm] at the target's location.",
    "[破茧]状态中自身获得[羽化]：受到伤害时不会产生僵直，受到的伤害降低25%，拾取范围增加15。": "When in [Flamboyance] state, Psyche gains [Eclosion].\n[Eclosion]: Grants immunity to Hitstun, decreases Damage Taken by 25%, and increases Auto Pick-up Range by 15.",
    "[破茧]状态中自身全属性穿透提高50%。": "During [Flamboyance] state, increases Psyche's PEN stats by 50%.",
