    "[倾情服务]等级+2，[自动保洁]等级+1。": "[Wholehearted Service] Level +2; [Automatic Sanitizing] Level +1.",
    "[清扫机]的攻击速度提高，[高温清扫]的转速提高，远程武器的攻击速度提高。": "Increases the ATK Speed of [Dirtexpeller], the Rotation Speed of [Pyrolytic Cleaning] and the ATK Speed of ranged weapons.",
    "[清扫机]进行射击时有概率额外发射1枚子弹，概率为[20%+15%×自身远程武器多重射击属性值]，[高温祛污焰束]伤害提高，提高倍率为[20%+15%×自身远程武器多重射击属性值]，最多提高100%。": "[Dirtexpeller] has a chance to fire 1 additional projectile. Chance: 20% + 15% × Hilda's Ranged Weapon Multishot.\n[Hyperthermal Purgejet] DMG increases by 20% + 15% × Hilda's Ranged Weapon Multishot, up to 100%.",
    "[清扫机]进行射击时有概率额外发射1枚子弹，概率为[30%+20%×自身远程武器多重射击属性值]，[高温祛污焰束]伤害提高，提高倍率为[30%+20%×自身远程武器多重射击属性值]，最多提高100%。": "[Dirtexpeller] has a chance to fire 1 additional projectile, the probability equals to [30%+20%×Hilda's Ranged Weapon Multishot].\nIncreases the damage of [Hyperthermal Purgejet] by [30%+20%×Hilda's Ranged Weapon Multishot], up to 100%.",
    "[清扫机]索敌半径": "[Dirtexpeller] Targeting Radius",
