    "[萨麦尔]蓄力攻击消耗连击点数时，会回复消耗量的90%。\n连击等级S释放[萨麦尔]蓄力攻击后，获得1层[冲动]，持续10秒，最多叠加5层，叠加时刷新剩余时间。\n每层[冲动]使自身技能威力提高12%，全属性穿透提高5%。": "[Samael]'s Charged Attack restores 90% of the Combo Points consumed.\nAfter using [Samael]'s Charged Attack at Combo Level S, gain 1 stack of [Impulse] for 10s, stacking up to 5 times. Gaining a stack refreshes the duration.\nEach stack of [Impulse] grants 12% Skill Intensity and 5% PEN stats.",
