    "[蓄势]最多叠加层数增加至200层，每消耗1枚[天工火药]，获得2层[蓄势]": "The maximum number of [Momentum] stacks is increased to 200. Each [Artificer Powder] consumed grants 2 stacks of [Momentum].",
