    "[喧闹下午茶]领域持续期间，自身造成武器伤害时，目标每带有1个属性额外触发效果，此次伤害的暴击率提高24%，并将其中元素属性伤害转换为目标的弱点属性伤害。": "During [Boisterous Tea Party], when Fina deals weapon damage, for each Bonus Effect the target is suffering, the CRIT Chance of this attack is increased by 24%, and the elemental type of the damage is converted to the target's weakness type.",
    "[喧闹下午茶]内伤害": "DMG Dealt in [Boisterous Tea Party]",
    "[喧闹下午茶]效果半径": "[Boisterous Tea Party] Effect Radius",
    "[玄蛟附身]状态中，每次释放[玉山崩]时，额外获得1枚[逆鳞]。释放[星河寥落]时额外为自身和队友附加武器攻击范围提高0.6和技能范围提高30%的效果，持续8秒。": "While in [Xuanjiao Manifest], each [Precipitous Thunderfall] grants 1 extra [Reverse Scale]. Using [Starstorm Descent] also increases Weapon Attack Range by 0.6 and Skill Range by 30% for self and allies, lasting 8s.",
    "[玄蛟附身]状态中，全属性穿透提高25%。累计触发6次[酣战]伤害效果后，对所有带有[酣战]的目标额外造成1次原本倍率130%的[酣战]伤害，效果每6秒最多触发1次。": "During [Xuanjiao Manifest], increases PEN stats by 25%. After triggering [Thunderous Onslaught] 6 times, deals an additional instance of [Thunderous Onslaught] damage at 130% of its original multiplier to all targets affected. Can trigger once every 6s.",
    "[玄蛟附身]状态中，自身和雷属性队友获得造成伤害提高效果。": "During [Xuanjiao Manifest], grants DMG Boost to self and Electro allies.",
    "[玄蛟附体]最大吸收伤害": "[Xuanjiao] Max DMG Absorption",
    "[巡天]状态[天工源能]消耗": "[Artificer Energy] consumed during [Heavenbound]",
    "[曳光虫]造成的伤害提高。": "Increases [Glimmerfly]'s Damage Dealt.",
    "[曳光虫]造成的伤害提高<Highlight>90.0%</>。": "Increases [Glimmerfly]'s Damage Dealt by <Highlight>90.0%</>.",
    "[曳光虫]烛芯单次造成的伤害达到12000点": "Deal 12000 points of damage in one action with any [Glimmerfly] Lampwick",
    "[夜行]等级+2，[回魂]等级+1。": "[Nightwalk] Level +2, [Soul Refrain] Level +1.",
    "[伊弥尔]第五段剑气造成伤害时，消耗目标3层[暗属性紊乱]追加1次1500%暗属性充盈伤害，视为同律武器伤害。成功消耗时，自身获得1层[燎原]，持续10秒，最多叠加5层，叠加时刷新剩余时间。\n每层[燎原]使自身全属性穿透提高10%，技能威力提高25%，武器攻击速度提高15%，武器触发概率提高20%。": "When the fifth sword wave from [Ymir] deals damage, consume 3 stacks of [Umbro Disruption] on the target to deal an additional instance of 1500% Umbro Overflow Damage, treated as Consonance Weapon Damage. Consuming these stacks grants 1 stack of [Wildfire] for 10s, stacking up to 5 times. Gaining a stack refreshes the duration.\nEach stack of [Wildfire] grants 10% PEN stats, 25% Skill Intensity, 15% Weapon ATK Speed, and 20% Weapon Trigger Probability.",
