    "[月猎]造成伤害后，目标在3秒内受到[日食]的伤害提高75%；[日食]造成伤害后，目标在3秒内受到[月猎]的伤害提高75%。": "When [Lunar Hunt] deals damage, [Solar Eclipse] gains +75% damage against the target for 3s. When [Solar Eclipse] deals damage, [Lunar Hunt] gains +75% damage against the target for 3s.",
