    "[召唤物·触手]攻击造成伤害时，有10%概率为[塔比瑟]补充1枚弹药，每秒最多触发1次。": "When [Tentacle] deals damage, there is a 10% chance to reload 1 projectile for Tabethe. This effect can only be triggered once every second.",
    "[召唤物·触手]伤害提高": "[Tentacle] DMG Boost",
    "[召唤物·海月水母]攻击时，有概率直接附加8层[爱之毒]，概率为自身近战武器暴击率的100%。\n[召唤物·海月水母]攻击时有30%概率额外结算1次目标的[爱之毒]伤害。\n场上每存在1个[召唤物·海月水母]，自身和[召唤物·海月水母]造成的伤害提高12%。": "When [Summon: Aurelia Aurita] attacks, there is a chance to immediately apply 8 stacks of [Poison of Love]. This chance is equal to 100% of Rebecca's Melee Weapon CRIT Chance.\nWhen [Summon: Aurelia Aurita] attacks, there is a 30% chance to trigger [Poison of Love] damage on the target an additional time.\nFor each [Summon: Aurelia Aurita] on the field, damage dealt by Rebecca and [Summon: Aurelia Aurita] is increased by 12%.",
    "[召唤物·海月水母]同时最多存在数量提高至5个，[爱之毒]最多叠加层数提高至8层。": "Increases the maximum number of [Aurelia Aurita] allowed on the field to 5 and the stack cap of [Poison of Love] to 8.",
    "[召唤物·皇帝]持续时间": "[Summon: The Emperor] Duration",
    "[召唤物·皇帝]持续时间结束前可消耗1枚[召唤物·战车]重置持续时间；[召唤物·皇帝]发射的水弹受召唤者远程武器多重射击属性修正。": "While [Summon: The Emperor] is active, it can consume 1 [Summon: The Chariot] to reset its duration. Water projectiles fired by [Summon: The Emperor] are affected by the summoner's Ranged Weapon Multishot.",
    "[召唤物·皇帝]技能伤害": "[Summon: The Emperor] Skill DMG",
    "[召唤物·皇帝]伤害半径": "[Summon: The Emperor] Damage Radius",
    "[召唤物·军团战旗]退场时，会额外造成一次召唤伤害。": "When a [Summon: Legion Standard] leaves the field, it deals 1 additional instance of its on-summon damage.",
    "[召唤物·审判]存在期间，伊薇及自身召唤物全属性穿透提高40%。\n[召唤物·战车]死亡时，[召唤物·审判]50%概率立刻释放1次[乐园巡游]，每2.5秒最多触发1次。": "While [Summon: Judgement] is active, Eve and her summons gain +40% PEN stats.\nWhen [Summon: The Chariot] is destroyed, [Summon: Judgement] has a 50% chance to immediately cast [Parade] once. This effect can trigger once every 2.5s.",
    "[召唤物·审判]技能伤害": "[Summon: Judgement] Skill DMG",
    "[召唤物·审判]释放[乐园巡游]时，概率生成1枚[召唤物·战车]，概率为技能效益×60%。": "When [Summon: Judgement] casts [Parade], there is a chance to create 1 [Summon: The Chariot]. Chance: Skill Efficiency × 60%.",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]持续时间": "[Summon: Chaotic Thunderorb]Duration",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]链接敌人时，如果该目标为首次被链接，[西比尔]对目标额外造成1次[军团惩戒]伤害，倍率为原倍率的500%，且必定触发雷属性额外效果。": "When an enemy is linked to the [Summon: Chaotic Thunderorb] for the first time, [Sibylle] deals an additional instance of [Legion's Punishment] damage to that target at 500% of the base multiplier, guaranteed to trigger the Electro bonus effect.",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]链接伤害": "[Summon: Chaotic Thunderorb]Link DMG",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]强化链接伤害": "[Summon: Chaotic Thunderorb]Enhanced Link DMG",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]伤害传递比例": "[Summon: Chaotic Thunderorb]DMG Taken Transfer",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]受到[夺神权柄]和[军团惩戒]的伤害时，伤害传递比例增加2%。": "When taking damage from [Divine Conqueror] and [Legion's Punishment], [Chaotic Thunderorb]'s damage taken transfer ratio is increased by 2%.",
    "[召唤物·紊乱雷球]效果半径": "[Summon: Chaotic Thunderorb]Effect Radius",
    "[召唤物·云螭]同时最多存在数量提高至3个。": "Increases the maximum number of [Yunchi] allowed on the field at the same time to 3.",
    "[召唤物·战车]持续时间": "[Summon: The Chariot] Duration",
    "[召唤物·战车]触发该效果时，召唤1枚[召唤物·皇帝]。[召唤物·皇帝]触发该效果时，召唤1枚[召唤物·审判]。": "When triggered by [Summon: The Chariot], summons 1 [Summon: The Emperor].\nWhen triggered by [Summon: The Emperor], summons 1 [Summon: Judgement].",
    "[召唤物·战车]技能伤害": "[Summon: The Chariot] Skill DMG",
