    "[震撼]效果命中目标时，额外造成1次自身[护盾值+超限护盾值]1200%的雷属性伤害。": "When [Impact] hits a target, it also deals additional Electro DMG equal to 1200% of Randy's [Shield points + Ultra Shield points].",
    "[震撼]效果命中目标时，结算1次目标的[过劳怨念]伤害。": "Target hit by [Impact] immediately takes the damage of [Overwork Grudge] inflicted on the target 1 time.",
