    "[正义群殴！]等级+2，[闹剧开幕！]等级+1。": "[Brawl For Justice!] Level +2; [Have Tricks, Will Travel!] Level +1.",
    "[正义群殴！]召唤的[召唤物·触手]个数提高至12个，同时最多存在数量提高至24个。": "Increases the number of [Tentacles] summoned through [Brawl For Justice!] to 12 and the maximum number of [Tentacles] that can exist at the same time to 24.",
    "[执行者]持续时间": "[Executioner] Duration",
    "[执行者]状态下获得50%属性穿透。": "[Executioner] grants 50% PEN Stats while active.",
    "[执行者]状态中，背水提升，[潜入夜色]替换为[暗影奔袭]，每隔3秒，将部分角色攻击力转化为最大生命值。\n[执行者]状态中，使用双刀武器造成伤害时，若不为追加伤害，则消耗5%最大生命值，附加一次基于最大生命值的额外伤害，该次伤害必定触发额外效果。\n消耗的生命值会在5秒内逐步扣除，最低扣除至30%最大生命值。": "While in [Executioner], increases [Resolve], and [Nightmeld] is replaced by [Shadowstrike]. Every 3s, converts a portion of ATK into Max HP.\nWhile in [Executioner], when dealing DMG with Dual Blades, if it is not Additional DMG, consumes 5% Max HP to deal additional DMG based on Max HP. This DMG is guaranteed to trigger its Bonus Effect.\nThe HP cost is deducted over 5s, down to a minimum of 30% Max HP.",
    "[执行者]状态中，转化攻击力间隔降低50%。": "While [Executioner] is active, the interval between ATK-to-Max-HP conversions is reduced by 50%.",
    "[执行者]状态中背水提升": "[Executioner] Resolve increased",
