    "[追猎]状态中，获得20%风属性追加伤害。": "When in [Relentless Hunt] state, Outsider deals additional Anemo Damage by 20%.",
    "[追猎]状态中，自身受到伤害时不会产生僵直，并获得武器攻击速度和背水提高效果。追猎状态下无法受到治疗，治疗量转化为等量的超限护盾。": "When in [Relentless Hunt] state, Outsider is immune to Hitstun and gains weapon Attack Speed boost and Resolve boost.\nOutsider cannot receive Healing in this state, and any Healing received is converted into an equivalent amount of Ultra Shield.",
