    "{性别：不好意思，这件是女装。而且是按照我的身材缝制的，暂时没有适合您的尺码……|真不巧，这件是按照我的身材缝制的，暂时没有适合您的尺码……}": "{性别:I must apologise. That's a ladies' piece, made to my own size. Not available in yours, I'm afraid.|What a pity. That one was made to my own measurements, so it's not available in your size.}",
    "{性别：大哥哥|大姐姐}，{性别：大哥哥|大姐姐}！你说呢？": "{性别：Sir|Miss}! What do you think?",
    "{性别：大哥哥|大姐姐}，你好你好，要买幸福硬币吗？这是妈妈留给我的，她说一枚烦恼消散，两枚幸福常伴，三枚……三枚想做什么都能做到！": "Hi there, {性别:Sir|Miss}! Would you like a lucky coin? My mum gave them to me! She said — one coin takes away your worries, two keeps happiness close, and three... three can make any wish come true!",
    "{性别：大哥哥|大姐姐}你放心回冰湖城，有榛子陪着我，不会有什么事的哦。": "Feel free to go back to Icelake, {性别:Sir|Miss}. With Filbert here with me, I'll be just fine.",
    "{性别：少爷|小姐}，您知道吗，您的恩情我一定会记一辈子的，我每天都来这里，从没想过能有这样的机会，我能和那些老爷们一样，走进车厢，靠在座位上……": "{性别：Sir|Ma'am}, do you have any idea what this means to me? I'll remember this kindness for the rest of my life. I come here every day, and never once did I dream I'd be given a chance like this. I'd be just like those rich gentlemen... stepping into the carriage... lowering myself into one of those seats...",
    "{性别：小弟弟|小妹妹}，刚刚我送你的香囊，可不是什么普通物什，而是获得悬衡派授权的独家限量版香囊。": "That sachet I gave you isn't just some common item you can find on just any stall — it's a limited edition, officially licensed by the Xuanheng Sect.",
    "{性别:小伙子|小姑娘}，你怎么看？": "So then, young friend — what do you make of that?",
    "{性别:小伙子|小姑娘}，听你这口气是来过我们华胥？来来，跟叔叔说道说道。": "You sound like someone who's been to Huaxu before, young friend.",
    "{性别：小伙子|小姑娘}你这眼睛，莫非也是让他们打的？": "Your eyes, {性别:lad|lass}... did they do a number on you too?",
    "{性别：兄台|姑娘}可真是一语惊醒梦中人！": "Good {性别：sir|lady}, you have enlightened me — with a single remark!",
    "{性别：兄台|姑娘}请放心，在下并无伤害无辜生灵之意！只是我今日在此抚琴，想要找些小动物来当我的听众。": "Rest assured, good {性别：sir|lady} — I've no wish to harm a single living creature. I'm to perform on the zither here today, and hoped the little animals might be my audience.",
    "{性别：兄台|姑娘}请留步！在下有一事相求！": "Good {性别：sir|lady}, pray wait a moment — I have a favour to ask.",
    "{nickname}，{nickname}，快来，我找到新的研究课题了。": "Hey, {nickname}! Come quick — I've found something amazing! A brand new research subject!",
    "{nickname}，还有什么问题想问我吗？尽管开口，我会逐一解答。": "{nickname}, is there anything else you wish to ask? I will answer whatever I can.",
    "{nickname}，你来了。": "{nickname}, you've come.",
    "{nickname}，你说你说，我去订制一款皎皎联名奖品，将来自海伯利亚的魔王大人作为压轴隐藏款，是不是一定能大卖特卖？": "If I make a collab with the Demon King and put it in as the secret rare drop — it's gonna be a massive hit, right? What do you think, {nickname}?",
    "{nickname}，你随时可以来枯荣阁找我打发闲暇。我会很乐意你来访。": "{nickname}, you are welcome to visit the Hall of Ephemerality whenever you have a moment to spare. Your company would be most welcome.",
    "{nickname}，你要出发了吗？": "{nickname}, are you setting out now?",
    "{nickname}，你也有对你而言意义重大的家人吧。倘若你犯下了言语过失，伤了那人的心，你会怎么做？": "{nickname}, you too must have family who are dear to you. If you had, in a moment of carelessness, said something that caused them hurt... what would you do?",
    "{nickname}，你找到那种土壤了吗？": "{nickname}, did you manage to find the soil?",
    "{nickname}，谢谢你这些天陪我，但我没有什么值钱的东西。这个相机，就当做送给你的礼物吧。": "{nickname}, thank you for keeping me company these past days, but I don't have anything valuable to give you. Please take this camera as a gift from me.",
    "{nickname}，又见面啦！我每天都在努力学习新知识哦，一起加油吧！": "{nickname}, lovely to see you again! I'm trying my best to learn new things every day, let's keep at it!",
    "{nickname}，这点东西你收下当赔礼吧，连累了你，怪不好意思的。": "Here, {nickname}. Take this as an apology. Sorry for dragging you into this mess.",
    "{nickname}的衣饰": "{nickname}'s Accessory",
    "{nickname2}……天啊，你做了什么！": "{nickname2}...My god, what have you done!?",
