    "《华胥风尚》记录了当前最受华胥人民欢迎的食肆酒楼、服饰杂货以及在异国风靡的最新生活方式。\n皓京特辑是每年奉香大典前一月发行的特别篇，内容以市内最新的吃喝玩乐去处为主。": "Huaxu Trends tracks what's trending across Huaxu: new places to eat and drink, clothing and everyday essentials, and lifestyles arriving from overseas and taking hold at home.\nEach year, the Haojing Special drops a month before the Grand Incense Rite, spotlighting the capital's latest go-to spots for food, leisure, and nightlife.",
