    "《萝湘辨法录》中的一册。民间调解员萝湘将自己对大风九章的独到见解运用于工作之中，并将心得体会集结成《辨法录》系列，因语言通俗易懂、内容贴近生活，意外地成为了风靡一时的居家休闲读物。": "One volume from Luoxiang's Case Notes. As a community mediator, Luoxiang applies her understanding of the Nine Chapters of Dafeng to everyday disputes, collecting her experiences into this series. Down-to-earth and practical, it has unexpectedly become a popular household read.",
