    白文: "Bai Wen",
    "白衣服的朋友，不知方不方便替我做个决断。这事情的来龙去脉，适才你也听过了吧？": "Friend, might you help us settle this? I take it you heard what we were talking about just now?",
    白银勋章: "Silver Emblem",
    白羽毛: "White Quill",
    "白子胜黑子输。": "White wins, black loses.",
    百宝囊·二: "Treasure Pouch Ⅱ",
    百宝囊·六: "Treasure Pouch Ⅵ",
