    爆炸案研究: "A Study in Explosion",
    爆炸半径: "Explosion Radius",
    爆炸范围: "Explosion Range",
    "爆炸范围+#1。子弹爆炸后，分裂出6个子弹再次爆炸造成伤害。使用此武器击败目标时，获得1层暴击伤害提高#2，持续15.0秒，最多叠加10.0层。切换至其他武器时，失去效果。": "Explosion Range +#1. When its projectiles explode, they split into 6 additional projectiles that explode and deal damage. When defeating a target with this weapon, grants 1 stack that increases CRIT Damage by #2 for 15.0s, up to 10.0 stacks.\nThis effect is removed when switching to another weapon.",
    "爆炸类子弹造成的伤害提高#1。": "Increases explosive projectile damage by #1.",
