    悲观皎皎: "Lunogloom",
    "悲观皎皎提供的求生工具，防止在活动中出现意外。里面含有30日份的罐头与淡水和针线包等。用于提升[欢聚一时]活动中的节日氛围。": "A survival kit assembled by Lunogloom, stocked with thirty days' worth of canned food, potable water, and basic sewing supplies. Used to heighten the festive ambience during the Festive Gathering event.",
    "悲鸣过后，世界才能重回寂静。": "Only after the last cry fades... can silence return to the world.",
