    "贝蕾，我……": "\"Berry, I...\"",
    "贝蕾，我累了。": "Berry, I'm tired...",
    "贝蕾：\n\n如果能看到这封信，就说明你还是回到了这里。\n你是个懂事的孩子，我相信你这么做一定有迫不得已的理由。\n我留下了一份用于远行的物资，埋在<H>飞船附近</>，应该足够让你们离开净界岛。\n愿你们此行一路平安。": "Dear Berry,\n \n If you are reading this letter, it means you've returned after all.\n You've always been a good girl, and I trust you had your reasons for coming back.\n I've left some supplies for you, buried <H>near the airship</> — they should be enough to get you both off Purgatorio Island.\n I wish you the best on your journey. Stay safe.",
    "贝蕾？为什么你会在这里？": "Berry? How come you are here?",
    贝蕾的幻影: "Phantom of Berenica",
    贝蕾妮卡: "Berenica",
    贝蕾妮卡·协战: "Berenica: Assist",
    贝蕾妮卡·阵亡: "Berenica: Fallen",
    贝蕾妮卡的: "Berenica's",
    贝蕾妮卡的衣饰: "Berenica's Accessory",
    贝蕾妮卡累计调整魔之楔槽位趋向2次: "Adjust Berenica's Demon Wedge Slot Track 2 time(s)",
    贝蕾妮卡溯源等级达到6级: "Raise Berenica's Intron Level to Lv. 6",
    "贝蕾妮卡携带的武器。缀有黄金装饰的单手刀，刀身的黑色金属并非随处可见的寻常材质——很显然，这并不是净界岛上的村民可能拥有的武器。": "The weapon that Berenica carries. A blade adorned with golden decorations. The blade is made from a black metal that is not commonly found. Clearly, this is not a weapon that the villagers of Purgatorio Island would normally possess.",
    "贝蕾有什么愿望吗？": "Do you have any wishes, Berry?",
    贝琳达: "Belinda",
    "贝琳达似乎意有所指……": "Belinda seems to hint at ...",
    "备骍犊，燔于南，以祭上天。\n取‌少牢，瘗于北，以祭厚土。\n于东祭日，于西祭月。\n设坎坛，分祀四方四时。\n祭时设三宗伯司之。\n太皓垂青者，执沉月，居中，祀神君。\n百家通达者，执苏梅，在左，祀先祖。\n逐艺卓尔者，执金檀，在右，祀社稷。\n不以绀緅饰衣，红紫不作亵服。\n祀时不语，献终以望燎一刻为宜。\n祭食不宿，逾三日则不用。\n\n注曰：其制繁杂铺张，不合如今华胥之风气，仅作史录记载，不应复之。": "Prepare a red calf; burn it to the south, in sacrifice unto High Heaven.\nTake sheep and swine, and bury them to the north, in sacrifice unto the Bounteous Earth.\nTo the east, offer unto the Sun; to the west, unto the Moon.\nEstablish the pit and altar, and offer separate rites to the Four Quarters and the Four Seasons.\nAt the time of sacrifice, the Three Masters of Rites shall officiate.\nWhoso Taihao favours shall bear the Lunarose Incense and stand at the centre, to make offering unto the Divine Lord.\nWhoso is broadly learned shall bear the Sumei Incense and stand to the left, to make offering unto the ancestors.\nWhoso excels in the myriad arts shall bear the Aurumwood Incense and stand to the right, to make offering unto the Spirits of Land and Grain.\nLet no garments be adorned with deep indigo or dark crimson; let neither red nor purple be worn as inner raiment.\nSpeak not during the rite. When the offerings are complete, keep watch over the sacrificial fire for the space of a quarter-hour.\nLet sacrificial food not be kept overnight; should it be kept beyond three days, it shall not be used.\n\nNote: These regulations are intricate and lavish, and do not accord with the temper of Huaxu today. They are set down here only as a record of former times and ought not to be restored.",
    备选役A: "Candidate A",
    备选役B: "Candidate B",
    背水: "Resolve",
    背水·决断: "Resolve – Volition",
    "背水+#1。风属性角色释放终结技后获得[千风祈盼]：背水提高#2，攻击速度提高#3，持续15.0秒，每次造成技能伤害和远程武器伤害可令持续时间延长0.2秒。": "Resolve +#1. After an Anemo character uses their Ultimate Skill, grants [Thousand Winds' Blessing]: increases Resolve by #2 and ATK Speed by #3 for 15.0s. Each instance of Skill DMG or Ranged Weapon DMG extends the duration by 0.2s.",
    "背水+0.8%": "Resolve +0.8%",
    "背水+1.6%": "Resolve +1.6%",
    "背水+2.4%": "Resolve +2.4%",
    背水提高: "Resolve Boost",
    "背水提高，生命百分比较低时效果更强。": "Increases Resolve. The effect intensifies at lower HP.",
    "背水提高<Highlight>10.8%</>": "+<Highlight>10.8%</> Resolve",
    "背向着九神的暗月派崇奉着“深渊”，他们理念的汇编理所当然地被视为禁忌。但禁忌总是诱人，只要有心，新世界的大门随时会开启。": "The Noclunism, renouncing the Great Nine to embrace the \"Abyss\", compiles its doctrines in a tome naturally deemed taboo. Yet, such forbidden knowledge beckons enticingly — for the curious, it unlocks gateways to a new world.",
    "背着行囊的爽朗青年走到篝火旁，大声打了个招呼。": "A cheerful young man with a backpack walks up to the campfire and greets you loudly.",
    "被“她”压在身下真的会死吧……": "You really would die if you ended up under \"her,\" though...",
    "被[召唤物·触手]抓取的敌人，每2秒受到[召唤物·触手]攻击力280%的水属性持续伤害。": "Enemies captured by [Tentacle] take Hydro Damage equivalent to 280% of [Tentacle]'s ATK once every 2s.",
    "被标记时，法露茜对其造成一次充盈伤害并附加一层[火属性紊乱]。\n法露茜对[处决目标]造成的伤害提升，当[处决目标]死亡时，若法露茜处于[执行者]状态中，选择一个新的[处决目标]。": "When marked, the target takes 1 instance of Overflow Damage from Falsi and gains 1 stack of [Pyro Disruption].\nFalsi deals increased damage to [Execution Targets]. If an [Execution Target] dies while Falsi is in [Executioner], a new one is selected.",
    "被冲上沙滩的贝壳每天都有，但能捡到外壳完整，色彩丰富的个体仍是一种幸运。": "Seashells are washed up on the beach every day, but finding one intact and vibrantly coloured is always a small stroke of luck.",
    "被存放于保险柜中的镇痛剂。": "Painkiller stored in a safe.",
    被动: "Passive",
