    "参与游戏需要入场卷，一点小钱，但是赢了就可以将输家的钱归于自己，怎么样，是不是很有趣的游戏？": "Costs next to nothing to sit in. Win, and you walk away with the other fellow's money. Well? Sounds like a bit of fun, doesn't it?",
