    "操纵风师叁号，消耗所有神智进入[歼星模式]状态，每消耗30点神智，获得1层[遨游]，最多叠加10层。基于自身远程武器的最大弹药量，获得[天工火药]，最多获得300枚。\n[歼星模式]状态持续期间，无法使用武器，自身受到伤害时不会产生僵直，再次使用此技能时退出[歼星模式]状态。\n近战攻击被替换为[剑如虹]，远程攻击被替换为[星如雨]。": "Activates [Starfall Mode] by consuming all Sanity with Fengshi Type Ⅲ. Gain 1 stack of [Soar] for every 30 Sanity consumed, up to 10 stacks. Gain [Artificer Powder] based on the maximum ammo capacity of the equipped ranged weapon, up to 300 rounds.\nWhile in [Starfall Mode], weapons become unavailable, and Su Yi becomes immune to Hitstun. Recasting the skill deactivates [Starfall Mode].\nWhile in this mode, melee attacks are replaced with [Sword Aflash], and ranged attacks are replaced with [Stars Ashower].",
    "草木深胡同……是在这里？还是……": "Overgrown Hutong... should be this way...? Or...",
    噌噌皎皎: "Lunosprout",
    "层峦叠嶂，山外有天。": "Beyond every peak lies a higher sky.",
    "曾经的……灾难？": "What disaster?",
    "曾经的机枢派，是多么百花齐放，书本上说，机傀术几乎每天都会进行迭代。更优越的性能，更炫酷的外型……": "The Jishu Sect used to be a garden of innovation! The history books say Mechapuppetry was iterating daily back then. Superior performance, magnificent designs...",
    "曾经皓京最大的藏书阁，便是竹溪先生与其他同僚共同主持倡导，才修建落地，只可惜后来被歹人烧毁大半……实属憾事。": "The greatest library Haojing ever saw was built through the advocacy of Master Zhuxi and his colleagues. It is a profound tragedy that scoundrels later burned down the majority of it... a great loss indeed.",
    "曾经有一个异邦人，她长得漂漂亮亮的，带着一个方方正正的小盒子，我问她盒子里装着什么，她却不愿意告诉我。": "Once, there was a pretty girl from a faraway place. She carried a little square box, and when I asked what was inside, she wouldn't tell me.",
