    "茶会开始了，这里有绚烂的烟花，华丽的盛装，无尽的糖果，可爱的动物以及人们的欢笑；\n茶会开始了，这里有肆虐的风暴，绚烂的烟花，华丽的盛装，无尽的糖果，可爱的动物以及人们的欢笑；\n茶会开始了，这里有燃烧的舞台，绚烂的烟花，华丽的盛装，无尽的糖果，可爱的动物以及人们的欢笑；\n茶会开始了，这里有茂密的苔藓，绚烂的烟花，华丽的盛装，无尽的糖果，可爱的动物以及人们的欢笑；\n茶会开始了，这里有绚烂的烟花，华丽的盛装，无尽的糖果，可爱的动物以及人们的欢笑；\n来吧，兔子将为我们斟上蜜酒，花朵将为我们抹上糖霜；\n来吧，一起在夏夜焰火中落座，为这美好的时光，献上永不落幕的祝福。": "The tea party has begun. There are dazzling fireworks, beautiful finery, endless sweets, dear little animals, and merry laughter.\nThe tea party has begun. There are raging storms, dazzling fireworks, beautiful finery, endless sweets, dear little animals, and merry laughter.\nThe tea party has begun. There is a burning stage, dazzling fireworks, beautiful finery, endless sweets, dear little animals, and merry laughter.\nThe tea party has begun. There is creeping moss, dazzling fireworks, beautiful finery, endless sweets, dear little animals, and merry laughter.\nThe tea party has begun. There are dazzling fireworks, beautiful finery, endless sweets, dear little animals, and merry laughter.\nCome now. The rabbits will pour us mead, and the flowers will dust us with sugar.\nCome now. Take your seats beneath the summer-night fireworks, and raise a blessing to this beautiful hour — one that shall never fade.",
    茶摊老板: "Tea Stall Owner",
    茶温公: "Chawen",
    "茶温公，你这八百个心眼子的家伙，心里又打着什么算盘呢？难道那批龙戚戚身后有你参与？你这老东西！": "You sly old fox, Chawen — what are you plotting this time? Don't tell me you've a hand in that mysterious batch yourself!",
    "差不多……？": "Something like that...",
    "差不多……吧。": "More or less... yes.",
    "差不多得啦……": "Come on now, that's enough, you two...",
    "差点真给你糊弄住了，你以为人人都是蠢蛋？上面要是真来人调查的话，肯定会提前让我别来上班。": "Nice try. Almost had me for a second. What, you think I'm stupid? If inspectors were really coming, they'd have told me to clear out and stay well out of sight.",
