    "吵得我们头疼，只能把他们丢出去。": "They make so much noise it gives us a headache... so in the end we have to guide them out too.",
    吵闹的学生: "Loud Student",
    "吵死了……这怎么让人背书！": "They're too loud... How's anyone meant to learn like this!?",
    车轮滚滚: "Vehicle Wheel",
    车站工卡: "Station Work Pass",
    车站工人: "Station Worker",
    车站监工: "Foreman",
    车站警卫: "Station Guard",
    车站警卫的声音: "Station Guard's Voice",
    "车站任职人员日常调查。": "Just a routine staff inspection.",
    车站卫兵: "Station Guard",
    "车站以群花的公主为名。": "The station takes its name from the Princess of Blossoms.",
    车长: "Conductor",
    "尘封旧事，光阴沉寂。": "What cannot be forgotten lies still, untouched by time.",
    "尘漠深处，群玄鸣啸。": "In the heart of the Gritblight, the sable pack prowls and howls.",
    尘漠石海: "Gritblight Expanse",
    "尘漠石海曾因烛阴之灾而沦为无人之境，令华胥人闻之心惊。现烛阴归位，此地的晶尘化现象却无法彻底改缮，为消弭群众心中对于此地的恐惧，也为了清理此地剩余的盘踞秽兽，大典官方将第二道赛场安排在这里。": "Once laid waste by the Scourge of Zhuyin, the Gritblight Expanse became a name spoken with dread. Though Zhuyin has since returned, the Gritblight that scars this land cannot be fully undone. To dispel lingering fear among the populace, and to purge the Filthoids still roaming the area, the organisers have established the second arena upon this desolate ground.",
    尘沙的回声: "Whispers of the Sands",
    尘沙的另一岸: "Beyond the Sands",
    尘息蝶: "Gritfly",
    "尘香袅袅龙君现，典前争辉竞纷纭。奉香大典特别活动——灯谜会，待君赏玩！": "\"Where incense hangs on the air, Lord Argent descends; on the eve of the Rite, the forecourt is awash with light.\" In honour of the Rite, we present a special event: the Lantern Riddle Fair. Do come and enjoy it.",
    "尘嚣无染，碧波破浪。": "Above the din, beyond the froth — a solitary cruise on an endless emerald.",
    "沉沉的睡意涌了上来。\n你眼前的黑暗如纸一般被揉皱，浸湿在水里。\n……": "A leaden drowsiness creeps over you.\nThe darkness before your eyes crumples like parchment, dissolving in water.\n ……",
    沉浸式戏剧: "Immersive Theatre",
    "沉眠着秘密的宅邸。": "A house where secrets slumber.",
    "沉默，有时比任何言语都更有分量。": "Silence can carry more weight than words.",
    "沉默。": "Remain silent.",
    "沉默而无声的礁石，守望着风暴中混沌的思绪。": "A silent reef, keeping watch over storm-tossed thoughts.",
    沉默鸢尾·焦糖: "Hushed Iris: Caramel",
    沉默鸢尾·墨玉: "Hushed Iris: Dark Jade",
    沉默鸢尾·涅白: "Hushed Iris: Opaque White",
    沉默鸢尾·铅灰: "Hushed Iris: Leaden Grey",
    "沉入黑暗，巡猎光明。": "Sink into the darkness and hunt for the light.",
    "沉入漆黑的波浪时，黄金双刀的主人将这最宝贵之物高举奉向神明，可神明却并未垂怜于他。": "As the dark tide rose, the wielder raised these golden blades in offering — a final prayer to a silent god who never answered.",
    沉鲨: "Siltshark",
    沉鲨·异种: "Siltshark Variant",
