    沉稳的女生: "Clear-headed Girl",
    "沉月香早晨已经有香官来取走了，当时你不是在村子里吗？": "One of the incense wardens came for the Lunarose this morning. Were you not in the village?",
    陈白沙: "Chen Baisha",
    陈川: "Chen Chuan",
    陈旧的日记: "Yellowed Diary",
    陈老爹: "Old Man Chen",
    陈楠卿: "Chen Nanqing",
    陈岐: "Chen Qi",
    "晨光挥洒，勾勒出轻柔的问候。": "A gentle greeting carried on the morning light.",
    晨昏: "Dawn Beyond Night",
    晨间致候: "Morning Greeting",
    "晨雾初起时，你也将踏上前路。": "As the first mist of morning rises, so too do you set out.",
    趁热打铁: "Seize the Moment",
    "趁着你还没有被各种律法束缚，想做什么事情，就去做吧。": "Do what you need to. Cherish your freedom before the chains of law bind you.",
    称号: "Title",
    "称呼已经是前辈了吗，你再想想……": "\"{性别:Sir|Ma'am}\" now, is it? Let me think...",
    "成不成也不是你说了算，你这顽固，我不与你分说了！": "Whether it ends well isn't for you to decide. You stubborn fool — I'm done talking to you.",
    "成对出没的小型鱼类，善于弹跳，可短暂离开水中爬行，生活在海边或河边的浅滩上，打洞生活。会以水让身体保持湿润，因此被赋予了“相濡以沫”的含义，被古籍认为是忠贞感情的证明，近年来因为外形古怪也颇受喜爱。": "A small fish often seen in pairs, nimble enough to leap and able to crawl briefly on land. It lives across coastal shallows and riverbanks, digging small dens and keeping its partner wet by splashing water over it. This behaviour made it a symbol of mutual devotion in old texts, and in recent years its quirky appearance has made it rather popular.",
    成功取得龙莎要塞的三处货运升降梯操作权限: "Secure control of all three cargo lifts at Lonza Fortress",
