    "成功拾取掉落物时，获得<Highlight>45.0</>超限护盾，效果每<Highlight>5.0</>秒最多触发1次。": "Picking up dropped items gains <Highlight>45.0</> Ultra Shields. This effect can only be triggered once every <Highlight>2</>s.",
    "成功拾取掉落物时，获得超限护盾。": "Picking up dropped items grants Ultra Shields.",
