    "帝国的贵族都是像你这样时刻注意自己的仪态吗？": "Are all the Empire's nobles so attentive to their manners?",
    帝国的脉动: "Pulse of the Empire",
    "帝国的罪犯还在满大街地跑，身为典狱长哪有什么闲暇时间。只能在忙里偷闲的时候，喝几杯烈酒。": "With criminals still roaming the streets of the Empire, spare time is a luxury for a warden. The only respite I get is when I sneak in a few strong drinks amidst a busy schedule.",
    "帝国敌视卡戎，想必他们也看不惯你吧。": "Given the Empire's disdain for Charons, I imagine they don't look kindly on you either.",
    "帝国皇家军监狱典狱长，她的锁链将会惩戒罪恶，她的火焰将会坚守正义。": "The Warden of the Imperial Military Prison wields her chains to chastise evil and her flames to defend justice.",
    帝国求生指南: "Empire Survival Guide",
