    "点按时，释放[解天机·震]。对面前范围内的敌人造成雷属性伤害，自身获得1枚[泉符·震]。\n长按时，释放[解天机·巽]。对周围范围内的敌人造成雷属性伤害，并为自身附加超限护盾，自身获得1枚[泉符·巽]。": "Press: \nZhiliu uses [Celestial Revelation: Zhen], dealing Electro Damage to enemies within range, which grants Zhiliu 1 [Talisman: Zhen].\n\nHold:\nZhiliu uses [Celestial Revelation: Xun], dealing Electro Damage to enemies within range, which grants Zhiliu Ultra Shield and 1 [Talisman: Xun].",
    "点按时，释放[小步]，对面前的敌人造成暗属性伤害，视为近战武器伤害，并获得10层[交响]。\n长按时，释放[跃步]，松开长按可提前结束技能。向前突进，沿途造成最多5次暗属性范围伤害，视为近战武器伤害，并获得10层[交响]。\n[交响]最多叠加30层，满层时释放[小步][跃步]不消耗神智。": "Tap to perform [Petit Pas], dealing Umbro DMG to enemies ahead. This counts as Melee Weapon DMG and grants 10 stacks of [Symphony].\nHold to perform [Grand Jeté]. Release to end the skill early. Dash forward, dealing Umbro AoE DMG up to 5 times along the path. This counts as Melee Weapon DMG and grants 10 stacks of [Symphony].\n[Symphony] stacks up to 30 times. At max stacks, performing [Petit Pas] or [Grand Jeté] consumes no Sanity.",
