    "点点们不知道自己要去哪里，也不知道自己要变成什么样的点点，也可能最后会变成线，谁知道呢？所以我觉得点点们都是笨笨的家伙。": "They don't know where they're supposed to go, or what kind of dot they're supposed to be. Maybe one day they'll all join together and become lines instead. Who knows? That's why I think they're silly.",
