    "垫起脚尖转个圈，乐园中，她与纯白的旅客跳舞；\n“旅人啊，请不要离去，让幸福的日子再多一些吧。”\n蒙上双眼唱支歌，乐园中，她与纯白的木马告别；\n“白马啊，请停下脚步，让我从酣眠的日子醒来吧。”": "She rises on her toes and turns, a dance with a guest in white, here in the paradise.\n\"Wanderer, don't leave yet. Let these happy days stretch a little longer.\"\nShe hums with her eyes closed, bidding farewell to the white carousel, here in the paradise.\n\"White horse, stop for a while. Let me wake from this long, drowsy day.\"",
    "殿前广场那边时不时总有活动，庙会啊什么的，逢年过节人多的很，不过我们喜欢清净，不爱去逛。": "There's always something going on around the square in front of the hall — temple fairs and the like. Come festival time it gets so crowded you can hardly move. Not for us, though. We like a bit of peace and quiet.",
