    "房子原先的主人呢？": "What about the people who used to live here?",
    "仿佛闪烁着星辉的灿烂丝线，可用于在特定活动获取外观。": "A radiant thread shimmering with starlight. Use it to obtain skins in specific events.",
    仿生列车铁腕: "Bionic Ironfist",
    "仿照华胥赛事“奉香群英试”的模拟推演，可凭借该邀请函参与演练。": "Grants access to a special simulation modelled on Huaxu's Incense Proving.",
    "仿照华胥赛事“奉香群英试”的模拟推演。完成演练关卡，获得大量奖励。": "A simulation modelled on Huaxu's Incense Proving. Clear trial stages to earn generous rewards.",
    仿制钧天玉律: "Jade of Equilibrium Replica",
    "放老实点，别管与你无关的事。": "Keep your nose out of things that don't concern you.",
    "放心放心，就是考虑到了这一点，所以这次活动设置的谜题都不怎么困难，只需稍稍了解一些华胥文化，就能答上来。": "Rest easy, we thought of that. The riddles aren't overly obscure; anyone with a passing knowledge of Huaxu culture should manage just fine.",
    "放心前进吧！愿火车的汽笛声成为你冲锋的号角，帝国的战车在冰原上永不停息！": "Then go on without fear! May the whistle sound for your departure, and may the Empire's engines carry you ever onward across the frozen plains!",
    "放在抽屉里的信件，装订华贵。收信人是恩里克·埃塞尔莱德。": "A luxurious letter addressed to Henrik Ethelred, found in a drawer.",
    "放在以前，是机枢派帮助织星客们建造的卜天楼，但要说现在……无人在意的废铜烂铁罢了。": "Back in the day, our sect built it for the Starweavers — they called it a Tower of Divination. These days it's just forgotten scrap and rust.",
    "放在游乐设施旁的注意事项，拂去烧焦的灰烬仍能勉强看出其中的部分文字。": "Safety instructions posted beside an amusement attraction. After brushing away the soot and ash, parts of the text can still just be made out.",
    "放在桌面上方的信件，不知什么原因没被寄出。": "An unposted letter, gathering dust atop the desk for reasons unknown.",
    "放在桌子上的信件，已经被拆开阅读过，字迹工整。收信人是恩里克·埃塞尔莱德。": "A neatly written letter that lies open on the desk, already read. It is addressed to Henrik Ethelred.",
