    "封口费？为何？我在这交易之地，做着你情我愿的买卖，也不违反大风九章，如何会需要到给客人您封口费的地步呢？": "Hush money? For what, exactly? I'm running an honest business, nothing against the Nine Chapters of Dafeng. Why would I have to pay anyone to keep quiet?",
    "封面正中央画着神弃者同盟标志的羊皮纸，被什么人揉成一团慌乱地丢进了下水道，封面下方还有一行小字：“愿复仇指引我们的前路。”": "A sheet of parchment bearing the crest of the Forsakens. It appears to have been hastily balled up and tossed into the sewers. Across the bottom edge runs a single line in cramped script: \"May vengeance guide our path forward.\"",
