    "奉香大典期间放假，你们都去哪玩？我哥从外地回来了，说要给我带异国的玩具呢。": "School's off for the Grand Incense Rite. Where are you guys going? My brother's just got back, and he says he's bringing me some cool stuff from abroad.",
    "奉香大典为参赛者们准备的、用于计算赛中得分的货币。华胥禁武之前，均有分文武赛制，故而有文武两种算筹用以区分。后虽全境禁武，但这种积分算法依旧被保留了下来，只是不再细分文筹与武筹。\n如今，既已开辟全新赛制，故而武筹再度被启用，参赛者的得分也将由文武筹相加总筹作为计算。": "A set of scoring tokens prepared by the Grand Incense Rite for use in the trials. Before Huaxu's prohibition on fighting, competitions were divided into civil and martial categories, each with its own tokens for tallying points. Though martial force was later forbidden throughout the realm, the scoring system endured; only the distinction between Civil and Martial Tokens was set aside.\n \n Now, under the new format, Martial Tokens have been reinstated. A competitor's final score is calculated from the combined total of Civil and Martial Tokens.",
    "奉香大典意味着什么？意味着休假呀！我一直想去海伯利亚看雪……": "You know what the Grand Incense Rite means? Time off! I've always wanted to go to Hyperborea and see the snow...",
    奉香群英试: "The Incense Proving",
    "奉香群英试举办以来在华胥各地引起了极高的关注度，各路明星选手在赛事中的亮眼表现十分引人注目。为吸引更多年轻子弟接受华胥这场翻天覆地的变化，大赛官方邀请这些明星选手们参与挑战升级的特邀赛，并准备了对应的邀请函。": "Since its launch, the Incense Proving has drawn widespread attention across Huaxu, with its star contestants earning particular acclaim. To inspire more young talents amid the changes sweeping Huaxu, the organisers have invited these standout competitors to take part in an even more demanding Invitational, and issued invitations to them accordingly.",
    "缝上心灵的窗户。": "For those who'd like to avoid any eye contact.",
