    "浮星埠不远处的茶馆旁传来了阵阵人声，听起来像是在争执些什么。想来又有热闹可以凑了，不如去看看。": "Not far from Starwharf, raised voices spill out from the teahouse. An argument, by the sound of it. Might as well go and see what's going on.",
