    腐蚀的长剑: "Corroded Sword",
    腐蚀的长剑·异种: "Corroded Sword Variant",
    "腐朽，哈哈，原来树木也会伤感腐朽吗？明明和我们无由生一样，倒下后会引来新的生灵。不……不对，也许在它看来，腐朽并不伤感，反倒是我先入为主了……": "Decay... ha... Do trees mourn their own decay? When they fall, new life stirs beneath. Yet... that's my thought, not the tree's. To it, decay isn't sorrow at all...",
    腐朽配方: "Decay Formula",
    "腐朽是生命的终点，拥抱它，才能驶入永恒而宁静的港湾。": "A type of scythe favoured by Atlasia hunters, capable of taking down small Filthoids one might encounter in the wild with a single swing.",
