    父亲: " Father",
    父亲的宝藏: "Father's Treasure",
    父亲的声音: "A Father's Voice",
    "父亲似乎时常皱着眉，仆人们提起他的时候总是战战兢兢。但你不怕他，因为他总是把你抱起来，让你摸他的胡茬，你觉得他并不像传说中那样严厉。\n父亲很忙，他不常出现在宅邸，所以大多数时候老管家更像你的父亲。胡子老头儿的话很多，当你跌跌撞撞跑起来的时候他总跟在你后面，你不喜欢他唠唠叨叨。但现在，你开始觉得，那唠叨令人怀念。\n你知道，正是这些思念汇聚成幽暗的火，在漫长的战斗中给予你暖意与希冀。至少，为了他们，你必须战斗下去。\n……": "Your father always seemed to be frowning, and the servants spoke of him with fearful reverence. But you were never afraid of him. He would lift you into his arms and let you touch the stubble on his chin, and he never seemed half as stern as everyone said.\nHe was a busy man and rarely at home, so most of the time the old steward felt more like a father to you. The bearded old man was forever talking. Whenever you went stumbling off at a run, he was always hurrying after you, fussing and fretting the whole way. You found it tiresome then. Now, you find yourself missing it.\nYou know these memories have become a dim flame, one that has kept you warm and carried you through many a long battle. At the very least, you must keep fighting for their sake.\n ...",
    "父亲向来放不下娘亲，想必在天上也是不愿看见娘亲落泪的。": "Ma... Pa loved you so much. Wherever he is, he wouldn't want to see you in tears.",
    "父亲已经在家下不了床了，我只能来此奉香，以求龙君怜悯。": "My father is bedridden now. All I could do was come here and pray for Lord Argent's mercy.",
    "父神的身躯则化为大地，他高高举起的手臂化为山岳，永远伸向不知何时归来的神明。": "Ask's body became the land and his arms, upraised, became the mountains, still reaching for the gods... who no longer come.",
    "父神说：“看看那些受造之物，无法进入轮回者，他们无法战胜苦难，眼中流泪致失明，在咸水里颠簸沉浮，在城内与街上发昏。\n我不过只是帮他们抬起手，你不曾怜悯他们、不曾爱着他们、不曾眷顾他们，那便由我去做，有什么不对？”\n\n——埃斯加特部落传说": "Father Ask said: \"Look upon those you created — those denied rebirth. They cannot rise above suffering. Their tears blind them. They are cast adrift upon the briny waters, reeling through streets and cities alike.\nI merely helped them raise their hands. You showed them no pity, no love, no care. So I did so in your stead. What, then, was wrong with that?\"\n\n— A tribal legend from Askard",
    "父神说：“正因他们无法战胜痛苦，他们知晓那有多难捱，故而他们残忍，他们施加他人不幸时也决不留情。\n是了，母亲，我做错了。”\n\n——埃斯加特部落传说": "Father Ask said: \"Because they cannot rise above suffering, they know its weight all too well. And so they are cruel; when they inflict suffering on others, they show no mercy.\nYes... Mother, I was wrong.\"\n\n— A tribal legend from Askard",
    负荆鲀: "Thornbearer",
    负荆鲀·异种: "Thornbearer Variant",
    "负责这些物资的织星客出海后迟迟没有归来，我们不知道他是出了什么意外还是其他原因，但需要这批物资的各家各户等不了了，如果你方便的话，能不能帮我们找一些回来？": "The Starweaver handling these supplies still hasn't returned from sea. We don't know whether something has happened to him, but the households depending on this shipment cannot be left without supplies for much longer. If you are able, please help us secure replacements.",
