    弧光百劫的下弓臂: "Arclight Apocalypses: Lower Limb",
    弧光蝶·白樱: "Arclight Butterfly: White Sakura",
    弧光蝶·本色: "Arclight Butterfly",
    弧光蝶·铅灰: "Arclight Butterfly: Leaden Grey",
    弧光蝶·晴蓝: "Arclight Butterfly: Celeste",
    弧光降诞: "Arclight Descent",
    "胡搅蛮缠！竹溪先生曾说过，天上只有一个太阳，但太阳出来的时候每个角落都有光，岂不是说明先有的太阳才有的光？": "Preposterous! Master Zhuxi once said there is only one sun, yet its light reaches every corner of the earth. Does that not prove the sun must exist before the light?",
    胡老板: "Proprietor Hu",
    胡气满满的: "Tiger-Lit",
    "胡说！龙君辖下动物不许成精！": "Rubbish! Under the Lord Argent's rule, animals are forbidden from becoming spirits!",
    "胡说八道！没有我的剑斩不断的东西！你去！我倒要看看你能造出什么东西！": "Nonsense! There's nothing my blade can't cut. Go on, then. Let's see what you can actually build!",
    "胡说八道！你好大的胆子！怎么敢置喙大风九章的判决？大风九章就是天理，说什么都是对的，怎会不清？": "Nonsense! The audacity! How dare you question the Nine Chapters? They are the very embodiment of Divine Order, infallible by definition! How could they possibly be unclear?",
    "胡说八道！你说的这是下棋下得不好的笨蛋，而不是真正的国手，要是足够厉害，怎会有你说的这种情况？": "Nonsense! You're describing a hopeless amateur who doesn't know a rook from a turnip! A true grandmaster would never make such blunders. If they were actually skilled, that simply wouldn't happen.",
    "胡说八道！你说的这是做生意做不明白的笨蛋，而不是真正的大商贾，要是足够厉害，怎会有你说的这种情况？": "Nonsense! You're talking about incompetent fools who couldn't sell water in a desert! A master merchant would never be so easily bamboozled. If they were actually skilled, that simply wouldn't happen.",
    "胡说八道！你怎么不说是鸟儿聪明，听了一遍就学会了，和我那小孙儿一样，学什么都是一点通。": "Rubbish! Why can't it just be that the bird's clever? Heard it once and picked it right up, just like my grandson. That boy learns fast.",
    "胡说八道！我不管你什么村子，打架了、出手伤人那就是不对的，这在我们华胥是要被狴犴大人惩罚的！": "Nonsense! I don't care about your backward village. Fighting and harming others is wrong! In Huaxu, Bi'an would have every one of them punished!",
    "胡说八道。": "That's nonsense.",
    胡桃夹子: "The Nutcrackers",
    湖边营地: "Lakeside Camp",
    湖中夫人: "Lady of the Lake",
    湖中夫人·异种: "Lady of the Lake Variant",
    "湖中夫人远比它看上去的要危险。即使是捕猎，它的身姿依然优雅，一次“亲吻”注入的毒素足以让体型更为庞大的猎物轰然倒地。有趣的是，它从无伤害人类的记录，甚至会把多余的猎物分给渔民享用。\n\n——科普读物作家 哈莉艾特，《水中世界》": "The Lady of the Lake is far more dangerous than her beauty suggests. Even while on the hunt, it moves with breathtaking poise. One \"kiss\" — and even prey several times her size falls limp. Strangely, it is never been known to harm a human. In fact, it has even been spotted sharing its surplus catch with fishermen from time to time.\n\n— Harriet, nature writer, World Beneath the Waves",
    湖中照影: "Reflections in the Lake",
    "糊涂！那层纤维是要手工剥的！你从哪听说是用火煎？": "Are you stupid? You're meant to peel off that fibrous outer layer by hand! Who told you to leave it on high heat?",
    蝴蝶: "Butterfly",
    "蝴蝶飞过的涟漪唤醒了整个仲夏。": "A butterfly flutters, stirring midsummer from its slumber.",
    蝴蝶结·白樱: "Bowknot: White Sakura",
    蝴蝶结·薄荷: "Bowknot: Mint",
    蝴蝶结·本色: "Bowknot",
    蝴蝶结·墨玉: "Bowknot: Dark Jade",
    蝴蝶结·涅白: "Bowknot: Opaque White",
    蝴蝶结·锈红: "Bowknot: Rust Red",
    "蝴蝶了却了飞翔的故梦。": "A butterfly laid to rest its dream of flight.",
    蝴蝶梦·黛蓝: "Butterfly Dream: Azure",
    蝴蝶梦·墨玉: "Butterfly Dream: Dark Jade",
    蝴蝶梦·涅白: "Butterfly Dream: Opaque White",
    蝴蝶梦背饰·白樱: "Butterfly Reverie Backpiece: White Sakura",
    蝴蝶梦背饰·绛紫: "Butterfly Reverie Backpiece: Violet",
    蝴蝶梦背饰·墨玉: "Butterfly Reverie Backpiece: Dark Jade",
    蝴蝶梦背饰·涅白: "Butterfly Reverie Backpiece: Opaque White",
    "蝴蝶衔着三色堇，等待着主人翁的到来，奏响舞会的序章。": "Bearing pansies, butterflies await the star's arrival to begin the ball's grand overture.",
    蝴蝶效应Ⅰ: "Butterfly Effect Ⅰ",
