    活泼的女孩: "Bubbly Girl",
    活泼的少女: "Lively Girl",
    "活泼娇小的魔灵，永远无法在一个地方安定下来的它，总是抓着绵草的种子四处飘荡，寻找着那并不存在的旅途终点。": "Light as thistledown and never still, this tiny, lively Geniemon floats endlessly from place to place, carried by a single seed — forever chasing the end of a journey that doesn't exist.",
    "活跃急板：俯瞰日记": "Allegro Agitato: Observation Log",
    "活跃急板：辉煌号召": "Allegro Agitato: Call to Glory",
    "活跃急板：辉煌岁月": "Allegro Agitato: Years of Glory",
