    获得所有近战呐喊武器形象: "Obtain all [The Scream] series melee weapon skins",
    获得所有太虚游载具形象: "Collect all Taixu Rover vehicle skins",
    获得所有糖福禄武器形象: "Obtain all [Sweet Fortune] series weapon skins",
    获得所有远程呐喊武器形象: "Obtain all [The Scream] series ranged weapon skins",
    获得太虚游·本色载具: "Unlocked Mount: Taixu Rover",
    "获得武器的其中一人是名君王，父神嘉奖他的野心。人们站在他的身后，欢呼他的威名，歌颂他的征服。\n他没有停下征服的脚步，他坚信自己会拥有更多的簇拥，但他的敌人却越来越多。最终他被包围在王座之上，燃起烈火，将自己和荣耀一起焚成灰烬。": "One who bore this weapon was a sovereign, granted it by Father Ask in honour of his ambition. His people stood behind him, cheering his name and singing of his conquests.\nYet he did not stop, certain that ever more followers would gather beneath his banner. Instead, his enemies only multiplied. In the end, they closed in around his throne. There, he lit a great fire, reducing himself and all his glory to ash.",
    "获得武器的其中一人是名良医，父神嘉奖她的慈悲。她与人们心中的情感之弦共鸣，用琴弦波动的韵律抚慰躁动的心。\n可世间依旧有着如此多如棘刺般蔓生的痛苦，于是她萃出毒剂，将制造那些痛苦的身躯也一并清除。\n最终，脆弱的琴弦因无法承受更多而绷断，她被灌下自己亲手炼制的毒药，坠入无法睡去也无法清醒的长夜。": "One who bore this weapon was a healer, granted it by Father Ask in honour of her compassion. She could touch the strings of the heart, soothing unrest through the music of her own instrument.\nYet suffering still overran the world, knotting it like briars. And so she distilled a poison, hoping to cleanse the world of the flesh from which such pain was born.\nIn the end, those fragile strings could bear no more, and snapped. She was made to drink the poison she herself had brewed, and sank into a long night in which she could neither sleep nor wake.",
    "获得武器的其中一人是名战士，父神嘉奖他的骁勇。他不断向着更强者、再更强者挑战，一封封战书不断送至远方。他的名字成为强大的代名词，但他渐渐无法习惯没有战斗的生活。\n战斗永无止息。他倒在战争——这场没有赢家的角斗场里。敌友的尸骸是他的救赎，自己的鲜血是他的挽歌。": "One who bore this weapon was a warrior, granted it by Father Ask in honour of his valour. He sought ever mightier foes, sending challenge after challenge to distant lands. His name became a byword for strength, until at last he could no longer live without battle.\nWar granted him no release. He fell within it — an arena without victor or end. The bodies of friend and foe alike became his salvation, and his own blood his final elegy.",
    "获得武器的其中一人是名织匠，父神嘉奖他的才思。他织就的衣衫是花朵上沾染的晨露与海浪泛起褶皱时涌起的泡沫，他将美分享给世人，看他们为了追求美而行荒唐事。\n可他逐渐觉得无趣，于是他举办了宴会，推出一件绝无仅有的华美羽衣，但只供给唯一存活的来宾。\n于是人们互相撕扯，劈砍，直至鲜血将他一同淹没，直至天明。": "One who bore this weapon was a weaver, granted it by Father Ask in honour of his ingenuity. The garments he wove shimmered like morning dew upon flowers and seafoam upon rolling waves. He brought beauty into the world and watched people commit every manner of folly in pursuit of it.\nIn time, he grew bored. He held a banquet and unveiled a feathered robe of unrivalled splendour, declaring that only the last guest standing could claim it.\nAnd so the guests turned on one another, slashing and hacking until the hall ran red — and before dawn, the weaver too was swallowed by the bloodshed.",
