    机动能力强化: "Mobility Enhancements",
    机关1: "Device 1",
    机关2: "Device 2",
    机关3: "Device 3",
    "机关鸟就藏在那边的箱子里。怎么？需不需要恶魔大盗给你带路？": "The mech-bird's in that chest over there. What, do you need me to show you the way?",
    机傀大乱斗: "Great Chaos of Mechapuppets",
    机傀大乱斗·传颂会: "Great Chaos of Mechapuppets: Elysian Church",
    "机傀就应该强大！战无不胜！": "A Mechapuppet must be powerful! Unbeatable!",
    "机傀觉醒，禁忌复生。": "The mechapuppets awaken; with them, a forbidden art returns.",
    机傀苏醒: "Mechapuppet Awakening",
    "机傀一定要有娱乐性。": "A Mechapuppet should be entertaining!",
    机巧连天星: "Clockwork Constellations",
    机枢齿轮: "Jishu Cog",
    机枢洞天: "Jishu's Wonders",
    "机枢好啊，真的好；\n机枢棒啊，真的棒。\n走马跑千里呦，无敌木走马；\n齿轮转不停呦，神君也惊奇。\n机枢真是好耶，真是好；\n机枢精又巧啊，顶呱呱。\n跟我学机枢哦，学机枢；\n生活乐逍遥哦，乐逍遥。\n逍遥哦哦哦哦哦耶耶。\n\n——公尚朔": "Jishu's great — oh, truly great;\nJishu's bright — oh, really bright!\nOur wooden steed — yes, made of wood — runs a thousand miles outright!\nCogs spin nonstop — whirr, whirr, whirr — even Lord Argent gawks in awe!\nJishu's good — so good, so fine;\nclever, crafty — top of the line!\nCome join us now — come one, come all;\nlife turns easy — easy and light!\nFree and breezy — ee-ee-ee, yeah-yeah-yeah!\n \n— Gongshang Shuo",
    机枢幻想·墨玉: "Jishu Phantasia: Dark Jade",
    机枢幻想·涅白: "Jishu Phantasia: Opaque White",
    机枢幻想·锈红: "Jishu Phantasia: Rust Red",
    机枢密钥贰号: "Jishu Key Ⅱ",
    机枢密钥叁号: "Jishu Key Ⅲ",
    机枢密钥壹号: "Jishu Key Ⅰ",
    机枢派的: "Jishu Sect's",
    "机枢派的造物从南向北遍布整个华胥，哪个码头见不到搬运货物的木走马？天梁司还高居华胥三大司之一，这能叫没落吗？": "Our creations are found everywhere in Huaxu. At every dock you'll see wooden steeds hauling cargo. The Ministry of Works is still one of the three great ministries of Huaxu. And you call that \"decline\"?",
    "机枢派和飘零人都讲究世代传承。比方说，一个九十岁的老师父，收了一个十岁的孩子当关门弟子，那么门派里很多四十多岁的中年人都要管这个孩子叫师叔。": "Both the Jishu Sect and the Drifters take lineage seriously. Say a ninety-year-old master takes a ten-year-old as his last disciple — suddenly half the sect has to treat that child as an elder.",
    机枢派荣誉学徒: "Honorary Learner of the Jishu Sect",
    "机枢派为什么没落了？": "Why has the Jishu Sect declined?",
    "机枢奇巧，别有洞天。": "In every ingenious working, wonder quietly unfolds.",
    机枢少女的肖像: "Portrait: Miss Jishu Master",
    机枢少女的肖像·晴空: "Portrait: Miss Jishu Master – Clear Skies",
    机枢少女的肖像·喜悦: "Portrait: Miss Jishu Master – Joy",
    机枢探妙: "The Joy of Craft",
    "机枢有什么好！听我的，剑拿着，咱俩练两手才是真的。": "What's so great about the Jishu Sect, anyway? Come on, grab your sword. You and me. Let's have a proper spar. That's what matters.",
