    "基于目标的[柔板]层数增加伤害倍率，并移除目标所有[柔板]；如果目标带有10层[柔板]，自身回复神智并获得一定量的[沉浸度]，效果每次攻击最多触发1次。": "Increases Phantasio's damage based on the target's [Adagio] stacks, then removes all [Adagio] stacks. When there are 10 [Adagio] stacks on the target, restores Phantasio's Sanity and grants a certain amount of [Immersion]. This effect can only be triggered once every attack.",
    "基于远程武器的触发概率，[月猎]生成后，有概率在相同位置生成1枚[日食]，[日食]生成后，有概率在相同位置生成1枚[月猎]。通过此效果生成的[月猎]和[日食]不会受到[雾海安魂]的强化。": "Based on the user's Trigger Probability for ranged weapons, casting [Lunar Hunt] has a chance to also spawn [Solar Eclipse] at the same location, which in turn may spawn another [Lunar Hunt]. [Solar Eclipse] and [Lunar Hunt] instances generated this way are not enhanced by [Misty Sea Requiem].",
    "基于自身等级，每级增加自身50点超限护盾上限。": "Each Randy's level increases his Ultra Shield cap by 50 points.",
    "基于自身在场的[召唤物·云螭]数量，自身技能威力提高。": "Increases Skill Intensity based on the number of [Yunchi] on the field.",
    激昂: "Passionate",
    "激昂行板：滴水穿石": "Andante Furioso: Enduring Persistence",
    "激昂行板：辉煌远征": "Andante Furioso: Glorious Expedition",
