    吉姆: "Jim",
    吉赛尔: "Giselle",
    汲取本能: "Life-Draining Instinct",
    汲血花: "Vamprose",
    "即你我在师徒之理间，又有不同，其分而殊，即为分殊。": "We are both bound by the same governing principle of that relationship, yet our specific roles and circumstances differ. That distinction is what we call \"Myriad Reflections.\"",
    "即使没有祀烟阁来收购，我们也可以卖给散商。所以，这已经是我们能做出的最大的让步了。": "Even without the Hall of Incense, we could always sell to private traders. So I am afraid this is the furthest we can go.",
    "即使面对未知的猎物，猎人也能从它身上取下属于自己的战利品。": "No matter how unfamiliar the prey, a hunter can always find something worth claiming as a trophy.",
    "即使是朦胧的视野，也能感知纷繁的世界。": "Even through veiled sight, the world's splendour may still be felt.",
    "即使是朦胧的羽翼，也能飞往纷繁的世界。": "Even the dimmest wings may yet find their way into a world of splendour.",
    "即使现在的机枢派早已不同往日辉煌，但在锦云谷，他们仍旧受到大家的尊重和爱戴，此趟来皓京，我甚至还感叹了一下这京城还没我们锦云谷看着先进呢！": "Even though the Jishu Sect isn't what it used to be, they're still deeply respected in the Cloudweave Valley. Coming to Haojing this time, I actually thought to myself that the capital looks a bit backward compared to home!",
    "即使只是虚影，你也不想触怒他们，增加无谓的纠缠。\n于是你开始煞有介事地复述起你听过的那些关于暗月教派的传言——“死亡的本能”啦，“涅法的救赎”啦，“深渊即永恒”啦……人们的脸上露出微笑，他们不住地点头，附和起你的高谈阔论。": "Even if they were only phantoms, you wish not to provoke them needlessly.\nSo, with a solemn expression and well-practised tone, you begin to recite the tenets of the Noclunism — fragments once heard and half-remembered: \"The deathward instinct\"... \"Nepha's salvation\"... \"The Abyss is eternity itself\"... \nTheir faces soften. They nod again and again, pleased by your borrowed eloquence.",
    "极度稀有的魔灵，有着碧玺一般璀璨的光泽，曾一度被认为是只存在于吟游诗人诗歌中的幻想生物。": "A Geniemon of legendary rarity, its body gleams with the lustre of emerald. Long believed to exist only in bardic ballads and the dreams of minstrels.",
    "极度稀有的魔灵，有着黑曜石一般璀璨的光泽，曾一度被认为是只存在于吟游诗人诗歌中的幻想生物。": "A Geniemon of legendary rarity, its body gleams with the lustre of obsidian. Long believed to exist only in bardic ballads and the dreams of minstrels.",
    "极度稀有的魔灵，有着红玛瑙一般璀璨的光泽，曾一度被认为是只存在于吟游诗人诗歌中的幻想生物。": "A Geniemon of legendary rarity, its body gleams with the lustre of carnelian. Long believed to exist only in bardic ballads and the dreams of minstrels.",
    "极度稀有的魔灵，有着堇青石一般璀璨的光泽，曾一度被认为是只存在于吟游诗人诗歌中的幻想生物。": "A Geniemon of legendary rarity, its body gleams with the lustre of iolite. Long believed to exist only in bardic ballads and the dreams of minstrels.",
    "极度稀有的魔灵，有着欧泊一般璀璨的光泽，曾一度被认为是只存在于吟游诗人诗歌中的幻想生物。": "A Geniemon of legendary rarity, its body gleams with the lustre of opal. Long believed to exist only in bardic ballads and the dreams of minstrels.",
    "极度稀有的魔灵，有着紫水晶一般璀璨的光泽，曾一度被认为是只存在于吟游诗人诗歌中的幻想生物。": "A Geniemon of legendary rarity, its body gleams with the lustre of amethyst. Long believed to exist only in bardic ballads and the dreams of minstrels.",
    "极光，是自然的奇迹。": "The aurora is nature's miracle.",
    极光号劫持事件简报: "Aurora Express Hijacking Incident Report",
    极光号主炮: "Aurora Express Main Cannon",
    极光快车上的秘密: "The Mystery of the Aurora Express",
    "极光映射的冠冕，见证着人们温馨的誓言。": "A coronet cast in aurora's light, bearing witness to vows of warmth and love.",
    "极寒，是生命的禁忌。": "Life was never meant for the bitter cold.",
    "极速奔驰之后，享受片刻静谧。": "After a headlong sprint, savour a moment of stillness.",
