    晶莹触碰: "Crystal Touch",
    "晶莹剔透，却又廉价的碎矿石，作为矿物并无精炼价值，但却可以成为男孩儿送给女孩的第一块首饰。": "Though not precious in the eyes of the refining market, these clear and sparkling ores hold the heart's true value, which can become the first piece of jewelry given to a beloved one.",
