    倨傲的先人: "Imperious Forebear",
    剧目票根: "Ticket Stub",
    剧目特典: "Repertoire Keepsake",
    剧情: "Story",
    剧院工作人员: "Theatre Attendant",
    剧院经理: "Theatre Manager",
    "剧作家的夜晚是绝不可以付诸于睡眠的！在座的诸位谁能听从我的召唤，去为我、去为那即将问世的著作驱散那偷走灵感的窃贼！": "A playwright's night cannot be squandered on sleep! I implore any of you to heed my plea! Banish this vile burglar of inspiration so that my magnum opus may yet be completed!",
    "据传是一位被唤作风伯的老者所讲述的奇幻故事，由于内容充满趣味，这些故事被后人收录后编纂成书，虽然曾有部分成年人指出其中有些部分描写让人感觉不适，但仍被作为儿童读物在华胥境内发行并大受孩子们欢迎。": "These fantastical tales are said to have been told by an old man called Uncle Feng. They proved so entertaining that later generations gathered them into a single book. Though some adults find certain passages a touch unsettling, the collection is still printed across Huaxu and remains dearly loved by children.",
    "据锦云谷人说，此物名为——串串签！怎么样，要不要尝尝？": "In Cloudweave Valley, these are a local favourite — hotpot skewers. Care for a taste?",
    "据说冰湖城曾有不法分子因为一直被卫戍部队追捕而过度愁苦，最终一夜白头。这反而让他从卫戍部队的眼皮子底下溜走。在这之后他频繁使用染剂改变头发的颜色，四处游荡，最终让一群普通人也跟着染起头发来，远看像是水仙平原的门头，晃眼睛。\n——对自己发色非常满意的卡米拉": "It is said that a fugitive in Icelake, once pursued so relentlessly by The Escort that he turned his hair white overnight from sheer distress. Ironically, it was this very change that allowed him to slip straight through their fingers. Thereafter, he took to wandering, frequently altering his hair with dye, until he inspired a whole crowd of ordinary folk to follow suit. From a distance, they looked rather like the signboard above The Asphodel — positively blinding.\n\n— Camilla, exceedingly pleased with her own hair colour",
    "据说当时的孩子都很怕他，因为他经常威胁别的孩子把零花钱给自己，还会做出一些顽劣的恶作剧整蛊自己的同窗——直到成年，都是顽劣如此。": "They say he was a terror. He'd shake down the other lads for pocket money and play vicious pranks on his classmates. Even as an adult, he never grew out of it.",
    "据说是这样可以有一些提神醒脑的效果？我非她，焉知她之乐呢？": "She claimed it sharpened the mind. I suppose I'll never understand the appeal, eh?",
    "据说微茫市还没建立的时候，这船就不知道从哪飘来了，一直在岸边搁浅，后面这里逐渐有了人气，才给这船又捡起来利用利用。": "Funny thing about her, though — she's got history. Word is, this boat drifted in long before Haze Market even existed. She ran aground by the shore, and folk settled nearby, hauled her ashore, and put her to use again.",
    "据我父所述，那时的竹溪先生已经满头华发，双眼几近失明，虽是身形佝偻，但讲课的精气神却是让人浑然忘却他的年龄。": "Father said the Master was white-haired and nearly blind by then. Yet, despite his hunched back, he taught with a spirit that made you forget his age entirely.",
    "据我所知，没有树叶变成无由生的说法。": "As far as I know, leaves don't turn into Wishen.",
    "据我在冰湖城待了半个多月的观察，外城的卡戎基本都和你差不多，不过你也真不怕冷啊，你看我，才来了多久，就长冻疮了！": "From what I've seen in the two weeks I've been here, that's what most Charons in the outer city look like. Still, you really don't feel the cold, do you? Look at me. I've only been here a short while and I've already got chilblains!",
