    "绝无此意，龙君会欢迎每个心存善根之人前来奉香。": "Not at all. Lord Argent welcomes any who come with kindness in their hearts.",
    "绝无此意！且听我道来。": "Absolute nonsense! That is not my meaning at all. Hear me out.",
