    雷鸣·燎原: "Thunder·Wildfire",
    雷属性: "Electro",
    "雷属性角色技能威力大于100%时，每超过30%，造成技能伤害时无视目标3.5%防御，最多无视42%防御。": "When an Electro Character's Skill Intensity exceeds 100%, for every additional 30%, Skill DMG ignores an extra 3.5% of the target's DEF, up to 42%.",
    "雷属性角色释放技能时，获得1层技能伤害提高#1，持续16.0秒，最多叠加8.0层。": "When an Electro character uses skills, they gain 1 stack that increases Skill DMG by #1 for 16.0s, up to 8.0 stacks.",
    "雷属性魔法的结晶，通过深境委托获得，可用于灾厄武器熔炼。": "A crystal infused with Electro magic. Obtained through Abyssal Commissions. Can be used as smelting material for Calamity Weapons.",
    雷属性契约者魔之楔道具箱: "Electro Covenanter Demon Wedge Chest",
    雷夜陨玉: "Stormfall Jade",
    雷云摧朽: "Ravaging Thunder",
    雷之晶块: "Electro Crystal",
    蕾伊: "Rae",
    泪湖湖畔: "Lakeside of Lamenting Lake",
    泪湖畔: "Lakeside of Lamenting Lake",
    "泪湖是泪湖，酱汁是酱汁，鱼是鱼，从来没吃过这么差劲的泪湖酱鱼，端下去重做！\n\n——美食家艾森斯在厨艺竞赛时的点评": "This fish died twice — once in the kitchen, and once more on the plate. I've had bad fish before, but this? Easily a new number one. Off the table. Start over.\n\n— Ethans, food critic, judging at a cooking competition",
    泪湖鱼: "Lamenting Lake Trout",
    泪湖鱼·异种: "Lamenting Lake Trout Variant",
    "泪湖之夜是发生在冰湖城的历史事件。": "It happened here in Icelake.",
    "类似的香囊在华胥各地只有几家能贩售，款式还各有不同，香囊爱好者自然是趋之若鹜。我这摊子在烟津渡到此必游的清单里，也是榜上有名呢！": "Only a handful of places in Huaxu can sell these, each with its own design. Sachet lovers come running. My stall's even on the must-visit lists in Mistwharf.",
    "累，困，沮丧，疲惫……这些词在我乐观皎皎的词典里统统不存在！我想请你以其他的词语来形容我。": "Tired? Weary? Down in the dumps? Spent? Rubbish! Those words are not in my vocabulary! Describe me with something else entirely!",
