    棱镜: "Prism",
    棱镜商店限时兑换: "Source: Limited-Time Exchange in the Prism Shop",
    "冷冻后兼具力量和味道的雪纹鱼，重点是——就算肉罐头和保鲜纸会过期，它也不会过期。": "Frozen Frostline Trout — firm, flavour-rich, and shelf-stable. Outlasts canned meat, cling wrap, and maybe even your survival instincts.",
    "冷冽的风中，她再度点燃心中的余火，向未来致礼。\n活动期间签到5日可领取赠礼。": "In the bitter wind, the last embers in her heart flare to life once more, lighting the path ahead.\nLog in on 5 different days during the event to claim rewards.",
    冷却液: "Coolant",
    离经生: "Lijing Shen",
    "离开吧。": "I'm leaving.",
    "离开冰湖城也有几日，这次回来也该回休憩之所看看，只是……白去哪里了？": "It's been several days since you left Icelake. Now that you're back, you should stop by the Sanctuary... But where's Snow?",
    "离开此地。": "Leave this place.",
    "离开华胥的游客，在等渡船的过程中，也往往要带上几样特色纪念品。销量这不就来了？": "And travellers waiting for the ferry out of Huaxu usually grab a few souvenirs too. That gives the sales a bit of a boost.",
    "离开军团后，你还好吗？": "How have you been holding up since leaving the Legion?",
    离开这里: "Leave",
    "离群孤影转机枢，山外长空划羽痕。": "A solitary figure, separated from the flock, turns the pivot of destiny; beyond the mountains, a feather traces across the vast sky.",
    "离群索居的黯淡阴霾，执掌罚罪的应天都尉。\n行走于天命笼罩的无尽原野，\n与煜明为伴的，唯有今日使命与昔日长笛。\n旧曲声声，彷徨与犹疑似乎随风远去——却终究无法消弭。": "Shadowed by solitude and burdened with judgment, the Magistrate of Yingtian walks the endless plains ruled by fate.\nHis only companions: today's duty and the flute of bygone days.\nThe old melody drifts through the wind, carrying his doubts away — yet never truly erasing them.",
    离散幽影: "Scattered Abyssoid",
    离生: "Lishen",
    "离我远一点……我什么都不知道！！": "Stay away from me... I don't know anything!!",
    离砚: "Li Yan",
    梨与礼: "Pears and Courtesy",
    黎瑟: "Rhythm",
    黎瑟·协战: "Rhythm: Assist",
    黎瑟·阵亡: "Rhythm: Fallen",
    "黎瑟啊……": "Rhythm...",
    黎瑟的: "Rhythm's",
    黎瑟的衣饰: "Rhythm's Accessory",
    黎瑟小队士兵: "Soldier from Rhythm's Unit",
    "黎瑟摘抄的，两年前发生在盖雷亚剧院的一起斗殴事件。": "A handwritten record transcribed by Rhythm, describing a brawl that broke out mid-performance at the Galea Theatre two years ago.",
    礼貌的: "Polite",
    礼貌的贵族: "Polite Noble",
    "礼物来了，快打开看看合不合你心意！": "Here it is! Quick, open it — see if you like it!",
    "礼物拿来了，快拆开来看看合不合你心意！": "Here it is! Quick, open it — see if you like it!",
    礼物商人: "Gift Vendor",
    礼箱: "Gift Chest",
    李大嘴: "Mouth Li",
    李浣: "Li Huan",
    李礼一: "Li Liyi",
    李某某: "Li",
    李蕊: "Li Rui",
    李什: "Li Shi",
    李顺: "Li Shun",
    里埃尔: "Riel",
    里奥拉: "Riola",
    "理，是天地万物之理，是自然恒转之理，是道法伦常之理，是治家安邦之理，是一切正确的，合乎常理的理，是为人处事的准则，是规矩，是道理。": "It is the cosmic order and the turning of the seasons. It is the ethics of society, the rules of the household, and the stability of the state. It is everything logical and correct — the standard for our conduct, the rules we follow, the very reason behind existence.",
    "理论上是能够遮风挡雨的精致小伞，可惜实物尺寸与卖家照片上略有偏差。": "Elegant craftsmanship. Technically functional — for your action figures, perhaps.",
    "理论上说，只要学会了都能用，但就是这学会……也不是简单的事。": "In theory, anyone might learn to do so — but in practice, it's far from easy.",
    "理应装满私酒的酒壶，但是现在里面空空如也，只剩外壳。也不知道里面的酒最终进了谁的肚子里。": "A flask that should be full of liquor, but now it's empty — just a hollow shell. Who knows where the liquor ended up.",
    "理由可以举出无数个，但是归根结底无非三个字：我不愿。": "Plenty of reasons, really, but if I had to sum it up: I hate being bound by them.",
    力量: " Strength",
    "力量本归同源，工具是，兵器亦是。正如镰刀本该用于劳作，枪支本应是场烟花。\n通过特殊途径获取，可用于灾厄武器熔炼。": "All power springs from the same source, whether as tool or weapon. A scythe was made for labour; a firearm, for fireworks.\nAcquired through special means. Can be used as smelting material for Calamity Weapons.",
    力量的极限: "Hit the Limit of Strength",
    力量的极限·贝蕾妮卡: "Hit the Limit of Strength - Berenica",
    力量的极限Ⅰ: "Hit the Limit of Strength Ⅰ",
    力量的极限Ⅱ: "Hit the Limit of Strength Ⅱ",
    力量的极限Ⅲ: "Hit the Limit of Strength Ⅲ",
    力量的秘密Ⅰ: "The Secret of Power Ⅰ",
    力量的秘密Ⅱ: "The Secret of Power Ⅱ",
    力量的秘密Ⅲ: "The Secret of Power Ⅲ",
    力量的秘密Ⅳ: "The Secret of Power Ⅳ",
    力量的秘密Ⅴ: "The Secret of Power Ⅴ",
    力量的饰章: "Emblem of Strength",
    "力气大的娃娃一掌就能给瓜劈开，然后其他娃娃就都凑过来，大家吃瓜吃得满嘴流汁，诶呀……想起来就觉得日子有盼头了……": "The strong lads crack the melons open with one chop of their hand, and all the little 'uns come running. Everyone eating until the juice runs down their chins... Oh, aye... just thinking about it gives you something to look forward to, doesn't it?",
    "力有所能，就帮一下吧，童工都挺可怜的。": "It was nothing, really. Just helping where I could... Kids working at that age already have it rough enough.",
    "历经暮色的浸洗，驶过无垠的黑夜，而后，一起去往明天。": "Bathed in twilight, we sailed through the boundless dark — together, ever onward, toward the dawn.",
