    历练经验: "Trial EXP",
    "历史往往只展现它“愿意被看到”的一面，真相透过岁月被扭曲，被按照有利的方向塑造。": "History shows only what it chooses to. Over time, the truth becomes distorted — shaped to serve the interests of whoever is recording it.",
    "历史悠久的医学巨著，详细记录着各种疾病的病因、症状与治疗，虽然大部分疾病的治疗部分均为空缺状态，但就像书封上写的“只要是疾病，就有被人类战胜的一天”，这些空缺，终会经一代代医生、学者之手完全填补。": "A venerable medical tome detailing the causes, symptoms, and treatments of myriad diseases. Although many treatment entries remain unfilled, its cover boldly declares, \"No disease is beyond human conquest\" — a promise destined to be fulfilled by future generations of healers and scholars.",
    历战的阴影: "Battle-Worn Shadows",
    历战者: "Battle Maven",
    "厉害啊，居然真有用！": "Wow, you've got the magic touch!",
    "厉害吧？嘿嘿，但是这个不能白送给你。": "Impressive, isn't it? Hehe — but I can't just give you this one for free.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[浮海月]。本次探索略微提高[浮海月]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Seaborne Moon]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Seaborne Moon] during this exploration.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[辉萤石]。本次探索略微提高[辉萤石]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Luminite]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Luminite] during this exploration.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[汲血花]。本次探索略微提高[汲血花]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Vamprose]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Vamprose] during this exploration.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[流明枝]。本次探索略微提高[流明枝]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Lumitwig]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Lumitwig] during this exploration.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[炉心炎]。本次探索略微提高[炉心炎]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Core Flame]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Core Flame] during this exploration.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[噬影蝶]。本次探索略微提高[噬影蝶]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Nocturne Moth]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Nocturne Moth] during this exploration.",
    "立即获得<Highlight>1</>枚烛芯，优先获得[曳光虫]。本次探索略微提高[曳光虫]的出现概率。": "Immediately grants <Highlight>1</> Lampwick (prioritizing [Glimmerfly]) and slightly increases your chance of discovering [Glimmerfly] during this exploration.",
