    连击: "Combo",
    连击持续时间增加: "Combo Duration Increase",
    "连击等级提高时，对自身周围的敌人造成光属性伤害，并使[萨麦尔]受到强化。\n连击等级提高至C/B/A/S时，[萨麦尔]的强化等级对应提高至1/2/3/4级。失去连击等级后，[萨麦尔]的强化等级额外持续一定时间。\n自身根据[萨麦尔]的强化等级，获得同律武器的攻击范围和触发概率提高。": "When Combo Level increases, deals Lumino DMG to nearby enemies and enhances [Samael].\nAt Combo Levels C/B/A/S, [Samael] gains Enhancement Lv.1/2/3/4 respectively. If Combo Level drops, the current Enhancement Level persists for a short time.\nWhile [Samael] is enhanced, the user's Consonance Weapon gains increased ATK Range and Trigger Probability based on the Enhancement Level.",
    "连击等级提高时，额外获得5点连击点数。": "When Combo Level increases, gains 5 additional combo points.",
    "连击等级S释放[萨麦尔]蓄力攻击后，[不坚忍]效果额外持续一定时间。": "Unleashing [Samael]'s Charged Attack at Combo Level S extends [Impatience] duration.",
    连连: "Lianlian",
    连连补给: "Combat Supply",
    连翩驰: "Gallop Northwestward",
    "连启动都没有，连夜拆了个干净，可怜我花了多少心血，却见一眼他动起来的样子都不行……": "They didn't even let me switch it on! Tore it down overnight, right down to the bolts. After all my blood, sweat, and tears... I never even got to see it move. Not once!",
    "连日山雨，地湿泥泞，机傀生锈，需要额外购入一批维修器材。": "After days of mountain rain, the ground is waterlogged and the mechapuppets are beginning to rust. We could really use another shipment of maintenance supplies.",
    "连同你们的笑声一起，全～都装进盒子。": "And our giggles and chuckles in there too, every single one~",
    "连续2期完成“沉浸式戏剧”中所有的“热映剧目”": "Complete all \"Featured Repertoire Acts\" in \"Immersive Theatre\" for 2 consecutive periods",
    "连续3期完成“沉浸式戏剧”中所有的“热映剧目”": "Complete all \"Featured Repertoire Acts\" in \"Immersive Theatre\" for 3 consecutive periods",
