    联机模式下累计20次完成任意委托: "Complete any Commission a total of 20 time(s) in co-op mode",
    联袂演绎: "UI_DUNGEON_ASYNCCOMBAT_1",
    "联通天南与地北，联结远方与梦想，交叉的铁轨纵横，密织的站台如星点缀在海伯利亚充满希望的疆土之上，为吾皇效忠的子民们啊，让我们同心协力，携手并进，用双手铸造海伯利亚铁路的未来！\n我们热切欢迎以下人士入职百花车站：\n1、勤勉可靠，纪律严明，品行良好，充满希望\n2、年龄、性别、种族、工作经历均无要求\n我们可以提供：\n1、二十年老师傅手把手教学，所有你想学习的，在这里都能学到\n2、绝对稳定的收入，工薪按期足额发放，绝不拖欠\n3、每日餐食准时发放，绝对让每一位辛勤劳作的工人吃饱，吃好\n4、团结友爱的工作氛围，在这里，没有上级与下级，没有种族的隔阂，来了就是朋友，我们热切欢迎每一位忠于海伯利亚的子民\n加入百花车站，开启你人生的新篇章，即使无法在战场上为吾皇争取荣耀，也可以在这里燃烧你的价值，百花车站需要你，海伯利亚的未来也需要你。\n加入我们！加入荣耀！\n（多么慷慨激昂的一段招工广告啊，每一位读完的人都会被这一份热情所感染吧，待遇条件看起来也非常不错的样子。）": "Linking the far south to the distant north, bridging distance and dreams — our criss-crossing railways span the land, and our stations shine like stars across the vast expanse of Hyperborea. Loyal subjects of His Majesty, let us stand as one, march forward hand in hand, and forge the future of the Hyperborean railways with our own hands!\nBloomfield Station warmly welcomes all who meet the following requirements:\n1. Hardworking, dependable, disciplined, of good character, and eager to build a better future\n2. No restrictions on age, gender, race, or previous work experience\n\nWhat we offer:\n1. Guidance from veteran workers with more than twenty years of experience. Whatever you wish to learn, you can learn here.\n2. A most stable wage, paid in full and never late.\n3. Daily meals provided on schedule, so every hardworking labourer is kept well fed.\n4. A united and friendly workplace. Here, rank and race are left at the door. From the moment you arrive, you are one of us. We welcome every citizen loyal to Hyperborea.\n\nJoin Bloomfield Station and begin a new chapter in your life. Even if you cannot fight for His Majesty's glory on the battlefield, you may still prove your worth here. Bloomfield Station needs you. So too does the future of Hyperborea.\nJoin us! Join the glorious cause!\n\n(What a stirring piece of recruitment propaganda... Anyone reading it would surely be swept up in its fervour. The terms it promises even sound rather appealing.)",
    炼火的典狱长: "The Warden of the Inferno",
