    "炼金术师们常用的药剂，酸味刺鼻。": "A potion commonly used by alchemists, with a pungent, acidic smell.",
    "炼金术师们制作的魔之楔增幅工具。在材料紧缺的前线，如何用有限的素材快速激发出魔之楔无限的能量，一度是炼金术师们苦恼的难题。": "A tool crafted by alchemists to boost the power of Demon Wedges. On the resource-starved front lines, finding a way to unleash a Demon Wedge's full potential with minimal materials once posed a persistent challenge.",
    "炼金院研制的浓缩助燃剂，本身是有刺鼻气味的无色液体，为了提醒使用者该物品的危险性而被加工成红色。只能用于军事或工业，三勺就足以让壁炉的火蹿出烟囱，没人想看到这种场景。": "A concentrated combustion aid developed by the Alchemy Academy. A pungent, colourless liquid dyed red to denote danger. Used only in military or industrial settings. A few spoonfuls can send a fireplace's flames roaring up the chimney, and that's definitely an unwanted spectacle.",
