    "鳞片如青铜一般的华胥特产鱼类，在古时甚至有人把它的鳞片当做钱币使用。甚至有部分机枢派成员将其视为机枢派的祥瑞而加以供奉。": "Native to Huaxu, its scales gleam like polished bronze. In ancient times, its scales were once used as currency. Some members of the Jishu Sect see it as an auspicious omen and make offerings in its honour.",
