    "玲珑照暗夜，月光引归途。": "A tender gleam parts the night, and the moon's gentle glow guides you home.",
    凌波疾步: "Splash Streak",
    "凌波疾步，且看我腾空起，驾云去，身似飞雁过南关，蜻蜓点水不留痕！嘿！哈！": "Ripple-Step! Watch me soar! I'll ride the clouds! Swift as a goose flying south, light as a dragonfly skimming the pond! Whoosh! Hah!",
