    凌乱时间Ⅲ: "Hair-Blowing Time Ⅲ",
    "铃声与书页间，岁月匆匆溜走。": "Between the bell's chime and turning pages, the years slip away.",
    "聆听发条的回响。": "Listen to the ticking of the clockwork.",
