    "聆听自群星传来的亘古邀约。": "Heed the eternal summons of the stars.",
    菱生: "Ling Shen",
    领界: "Threshold",
    令狐宁: "Linghu Ning",
    "另外，我会送给每个初次来拜访我的人一件小礼物，只要一件带有你自身气息的铁丝就好，不急于现在，我会一直在这里等你。": "And one more thing — every soul who finds their way here gets a little gift from me. Just bring me a piece of wire that's been touched by your presence. No rush. I'll be here.",
    "另一方面，华胥本身对一些重要香料配额管理便十分严苛，尤其是像吿苍这种本地人大量需求香料，若是任由织星客们贩至海外，咱们自己不够用如何是好？": "And some of the key incense materials — they've got strict limits. Take Skylilies, for instance: folks here burn a lot of it. If the Starweavers ship it all overseas, what are we supposed to do when we run short?",
    另一个士兵: "Soldier B",
    "另一说是……（小声）你知道这里的人不好惹吧？": "The other tale is... (lowers his voice) you know the folk round here aren't ones to mess with, right?",
    "溜达？你不会是迷路了还嘴硬吧？记得带好香囊啊，可别碰上玄色狴犴喽。": "A walk, eh? You're sure you're not lost and too embarrassed to say so? Keep your sachet close, mind — you wouldn't want to bump into a Sable Bi'an.",
