    流光形象: "Lustrous Skin",
    "流光溢彩的晶石，折射间可以窥见整个阿特拉西亚大陆的绚烂，饱含全属性魔法的强大能量。\n通过深境委托获得，可用于灾厄武器熔炼。": "A crystal aglow with shifting colours. Within its facets, one may glimpse the splendour of all Atlasia, suffused with the power of every element. \nObtained through Abyssal Commissions. Can be used as smelting material for Calamity Weapons.",
