    "留在这也是浪费人生啊，我应该去点别的地方吧？我听说帝国军团对我们这种有能力的天才卡戎总是有优待的，就比如那个什么……第六军团？": "Staying here is just wasting my life, isn't it? I ought to be somewhere else. I heard the Imperial Legions are good to gifted Charon... geniuses like me, I mean. The 6th Legion, was it?",
