    "龙在任何时代都拥有万千拥趸，它强大、野性却又因鲜有人见而显得疏远朦胧。正是这朦胧的概念，为人们搭建起肆意挥洒想象的无垠热土。": "In every era, dragons have captivated hearts and stirred imaginations — powerful, untamed, and ever elusive. Their rarity only deepens the mystery, making them the perfect canvas for boundless fantasy.",
