    "略~没用的大哥哥，我走了，你和木头块说话去吧！": "Hmph. Useless carpenter. I'm off. Go play with your wooden scraps.",
    "略略略！我不管，你就是骗我们，除非明天我来的时候你给我吃饴糖，我就原谅你。": "Bleugh! I don't care! You're just telling fibs. Tell you what — have some barley sugar waiting for me tomorrow, and I might just forgive you.",
