    "落生香的原料研磨最讲究精细，一遍下来若是还有这种大颗粒，你得重新研磨一遍。": "Luosheng Incense needs a very fine grind. If there are still chunks this size after one pass, you'll have to run it through again.",
    "落在发梢的雪花，定格在了最美好的瞬间。": "Snowflakes rest upon your hair, forever frozen at their most beautiful.",
    "落在湖中的每一把斧头最后都会出现在无辜精灵的头顶。": "Moral of the story? If an axe falls into a lake, it's probably headed for an innocent nymph's skull.",
    "落在肩头的雪花，披着星辰，于冬日长眠。": "A snowflake settles on your shoulder, starlight-draped, and sleeps through the long winter.",
    落子无悔: "When the Stone Falls",
    妈妈: " Mother",
    "妈妈每次路过商店都说会买给我，上次说是一天做两份工，这次说是好好照顾妹妹，可是一次都没有兑现，好想要啊……如果有人能送给我就好了。": "Every time we pass that shop, Mum says she'll buy it for me if I do what she asks. Last time, she said I had to work two shifts in one day. This time, she told me to look after my little sister. I did everything she asked, but she still hasn't kept her promise... I want it so badly. If only someone would bring it to me...",
    "妈妈说的都是骗我的，什么叫我大了就可以长出角，前年说去年长，去年说今年长。结果还是什么都没有……": "Mum keeps saying I'll get horns when I'm older. Year before last she said \"next year\", and last year she said \"next year\" again... still nothing!",
    "妈妈味道？我敢打赌，冰湖城没有一位母亲会做出这种风味的食物！": "\"Taste of Home\"? I'd wager there's not a single household in Icelake that cooks anything like that.",
