    "梦中的灵鸟为你衔来新枝，带来更多挑战。\n通关限时灵鸟试炼，获取活动奖励。": "An Oneiric Avian Spirit brings you a new twig — and new trials.\nComplete the limited-time Avian Spirit Trials to earn event rewards.",
