    敏锐: "Keen",
    敏锐猎手: "Sharp Sniper",
    "名号的确是假的，白龙神君并未与我赐号，但要不是如此吆喝，如何才能让诸位听众驻足呢？白龙神君即使知晓，想必也不会怪罪于我。": "Aye, fine — I made it up. Lord Argent's never said a word to me. But if I don't dress things up a bit, who's going to stop and listen? And should Lord Argent catch wind of it, I reckon he'll forgive a storyteller his little embellishments.",
    "名叫月髓的血液，在海伯利亚的每一根血管流淌。": "A lifeblood called Phoxichor courses through every vein of Hyperborea.",
    "名誉、宽容与尊严——垂首乞怜便可得到一切渴求。\n她曾深信不疑，直至失去所有。\n悔恨来得太迟，逝者已不可追，\n唯有将这副残躯，炼作一把不折不退的枪刃。": "Honour, forgiveness, dignity — everything she desired could be hers if only she bowed her head and begged.\nShe believed it without question, until she lost everything.\nRegret came too late. The dead were beyond recall.\nAll she could do was forge her broken body into a blade that would neither break nor yield.",
    "名字这么随便起真的好吗？！不过倒是符合你的作风。": "That's how you picked your name!? Well... it does suit you.",
    明辉石: "Lumite",
    "明面上的说法自然没有，毕竟长了脑子的人都不会做出这种事情，但他要是真的带上去，其他乘客会怎么看？": "Not in writing, no. But anyone with a shred of sense knows better than to try something like this. If he brings a corpse on board, how do you think the other passengers are going to react?",
    "明明没有我家乖乖孙儿考得好，却回回在外吹说他那混账孙子有多聪明伶俐，简直胡扯！": "That boy's not half the student my precious grandson is, and yet that old fool goes round bragging about how bright and clever he is. Absolute nonsense!",
    "明明是光明正大地听。": "I was listening openly, actually.",
    "明明是在讲同一件事，但两边的口径却截然相反。索拉努斯·盖雷亚在华胥的史书中是一名恶徒，而在海伯利亚的史书中却是英雄。": "Same event. Two utterly different versions. In Huaxu, he is remembered as a butcher. In Hyperborea, as a hero.",
    "明明我想了个如此精妙绝伦的辩题，辩完后必定醍醐灌顶，效用堪比仙人抚顶啊！": "I have devised a proposition of such exquisite brilliance! To debate it would be a moment of true enlightenment!",
    "明明有着这么好的条件，为什么总是在偷懒呢？一会儿工头又要教训他了。": "You'd think, built like that, he could at least do his share. But no — always slacking off. Give it a minute and the foreman'll be on him again.",
    "明明在家中寻物之时都十分好用，怎么到了这大街上就一点作用都没了？还是我学习之时不够认真，才让这寻物之法大打折扣！": "It works perfectly at home! Why won't it work out here in the street? Maybe I didn't learn it properly... that must be why it's failed me!",
    明日倾颓的原型: "Prototype: Tomorrow's Ruin",
    "明月几时有，把酒问青天。": "When did this glorious moon begin to be? Cup in hand, I asked of the azure sky.",
    明玥: "Ming Yue",
    明哲: "Ming Zhe",
    "明知这只是无谓的希望，明知这样做只会让他们承受更多的痛苦，你终究还是没有忍住——\n你举起提灯，快步走到两人身边。在琉璃的光辉之下，笼罩他们的黑暗散去了，女孩的长发再次泛起美丽的金色光泽。\n得救的骑士们怔怔地抬起头，望向你。": "You know it is false hope. You know it can only lead them to greater suffering. And yet — you cannot restrain yourself.\nYou raise your Lantern and rush to their side. In the glow of Glazeystal, the darkness recoils. Her hair, once drowned in shadow, shines golden once more.\nThe two Knights look up at you, dazed.",
    "明智的选择。\n回头，转身，迈出步伐。本能驱使你逃离——尽管你知道，你已无法寻回行过的路。": "A wise choice.\nTurn back. Step away. Instinct screams for retreat though you know you can never retrace your footsteps.",
    鸣金万华补给礼箱·二: "Aureate Myriad Supply Chest Ⅱ",
    鸣金万华补给礼箱·三: "Aureate Myriad Supply Chest Ⅲ",
