    鸣金遥的握柄: "Aureate Drift: Grip",
    鸣金装饰补给礼箱·二: "Aureate Accessory Supply Chest Ⅱ",
    鸣金装饰补给礼箱·一: "Aureate Accessory Supply Chest Ⅰ",
    鸣鸾: "Mingluan",
    冥犬: "Cerberus's ",
    冥焰: "Netherflames",
    铭刻时光的: "Timeless",
    铭文拓本: "Statue Inscription",
    "命令[榛子]向前冲刺，对路径上的敌人造成风属性伤害，在撞到障碍物后造成风属性范围伤害。释放技能时，为自身和队友提供治疗，并附加造成伤害提高效果。\n骑乘[榛子]时，此技能被替换为[蹄蹄大冲撞]。": "Commands [Filbert] to charge forwards, dealing Anemo Damage to enemies in the path. Upon hitting any obstacles, triggers Anemo AoE Damage at the endpoint. While this skill is active, heals Truffle and allies, and increases their damage.\nWhen Truffle rides on [Filbert], this skill is replaced with [Trotters Charge-Charge].",
    "命令所有[清扫机]在自身周围持续旋转并发射[高温祛污焰束]。[高温祛污焰束]对扫射到的敌人造成火属性伤害。": "Commands all [Dirtexpellers] to continuously revolve around Hilda and fire [Hyperthermal Purgejets]. [Hyperthermal Purgejets] deal Pyro Damage to enemies.",
    "命名敷衍的长篇连载小说。以海伯利亚与艾利西安数十年前的战争为背景，以一名海伯利亚男孩为主视角展开的冒险故事，深受帝国年轻人的喜爱。": "A serial novel with a sloppy title, set against the backdrop of the decades-old war between Hyperborea and Elysium, centring on the adventures of a Hyperborean boy. It's a favourite among the Empire's youth.",
    "命名敷衍的长篇连载小说。以海伯利亚与艾利西安数十年前的战争为背景，以一名海伯利亚男孩为主视角展开的冒险故事。作为《天生无敌大军团长》的姐妹篇问世，深受帝国年轻人的喜爱。": "A serial novel with a sloppy title, set against the backdrop of the decades-old war between Hyperborea and Elysium, centring on the adventures of a Hyperborean boy. Published as a companion title to The Invincible Legion Chief, it is a favourite among the Empire's youth.",
    "命名敷衍的长篇连载小说。以一位叫赵昊的少年被选为龙渊上卿为背景所展开的冒险故事，深受华胥年轻人的喜爱。": "A lazily titled serial novel. It follows a youth named Zhao Hao, who is chosen as the High Chancellor of Loongyuan. Wildly popular among Huaxu's young readers.",
    命运的馈赠: "Fortune's Favour",
    "命运的脉络如蛛网般纠缠，无人能够预测。": "Fate's threads tangle beyond the reach of foresight.",
    命运纺锤: "The Spindle of Fate",
    "命运女神编织群星的轨迹，赐予我们前行的信标，引领我们获得永恒的幸福。\n然而，如今，人类却违背了祂的教诲。我们不再相亲相爱，甚至为了各自的欲望与利益，将冰冷的刀刃指向彼此。神圣的土地分崩离析，连祂的神庙也遭到亵渎。\n如果这也是祂给予我们的考验，是通往黎明之前必然降临的黑夜……那么，我愿为你——在遥远的后世来到此地的命定之人——奉上一份跨越时空的祝福。\n在<H>祂永远不会注视之地</>，我埋下了属于人类相亲相爱的世代的最后的遗产。\n愿祂慈爱的的纺线牵引你寻得真正的黎明。": "The Goddess of Fate weaves the stars into their paths, gifting us with guiding lights that lead us towards eternal bliss.\n Yet, in our times, humanity has strayed from Her teachings. We have forsaken the bonds of love and compassion, choosing instead to arm ourselves with cold steel against our own kin. Our sacred lands have crumbled, and even Her sanctuaries have been defiled.\n Should this be the ordeal She has devised — a sombre prelude to the dawn — then to you, the destined one who will one day reach this place, I offer a blessing that transcends time.\n \n In <H>a place overlooked by Her gaze</>, I have hidden the final legacy of an age when humanity cherished love and solidarity.\n May Her tender threads of fate lead you to the true dawn.",
    "命运站在尘沙的背后。": "Destiny lurks behind the dust and sand.",
    摸鱼大师: " Master of Slacking",
    摸鱼皎皎: "Lunoangler",
    "模拟演练中使用的货币，以奉香群英试使用的文武筹为原型。\n文武筹是奉香群英试中，为参赛者们准备的、用于计算赛中得分的货币。华胥禁武之前，均有分文武赛制，故而有文武两种算筹用以区分。": "A currency used in Treasure Hunt Trials, modelled after the Civil & Martial Tokens used in the Incense Proving.\nCivil & Martial Tokens were issued to contestants as a way to record their scores. Before Huaxu's prohibition on fighting, the competition was divided into civil and martial events, each with its own tokens for tallying points.",
    模拟战场对战记录: "Simulated Battle Logs",
    "魔法，很神奇吧。": "Magic... marvellous, isn't it?",
