    魔灵们的: "Geniemons'",
    "魔灵们喜爱的食物，可用于投喂魔灵，并将其转变成异化魔灵。\n对魔灵来说，简直好吃到变形。": "A beloved snack among Geniemons. Feed one this treat, and it'll twist into an Eldritch Geniemon.\nSo tasty, it's literally transformative.",
    "魔灵们喜爱的食物，可用于投喂魔灵。\n正如它的名字一般，魔灵如果会说话的话一定会大喊“妙、妙啊！”": "A treat favoured by Geniemons, can be used to feed them.\nTrue to its name, if these creatures could speak, they would surely exclaim, \"Yum!\"",
    "魔灵们喜爱的饮料制品，可用于魔灵突破。\n正如它的名字一般，魔灵如果会说话一定会大喊：“妙、妙啊！”": "A creamy beverage favoured by Geniemons — ideal ascending them.\nTrue to its name, if Geniemons could talk, they'd definitely exclaim: \"Yum-yum!\"",
    "魔灵们喜爱的营养膏，可用于魔灵升级，提供1000经验值。\n正如它的名字一般，魔灵如果会说话一定会大喊：“妙、妙、妙啊！”": "A nourishing treat favoured by Geniemons. Grants 1000 EXP when used to upgrade these helpful companions.\nTrue to its name, if Geniemons could talk, they'd definitely exclaim: \"Yum-yum-yum!\"",
    "魔灵们喜爱的营养膏，可用于魔灵升级，提供100经验值。\n正如它的名字一般，魔灵如果会说话一定会大喊：“妙啊！”": "A nourishing treat favoured by Geniemons. Grants 100 EXP when used to upgrade these helpful companions.\nTrue to its name, if Geniemons could talk, they'd definitely exclaim: \"Yum!\"",
    "魔灵们喜爱的营养膏，可用于魔灵升级，提供300经验值。\n正如它的名字一般，魔灵如果会说话一定会大喊：“妙、妙啊！”": "A nourishing treat favoured by Geniemons. Grants 300 EXP when used to upgrade these helpful companions.\nTrue to its name, if Geniemons could talk, they'd definitely exclaim: \"Yum-yum!\"",
    "魔灵们最喜爱的食物，可用于投喂魔灵。\n正如它的名字一般，魔灵如果会说话的话一定会大喊“妙、妙、妙啊！”": "A treat most-favoured by Geniemons, can be used to feed them.\nTrue to its name, if these creatures could speak, they would surely exclaim, \"Yum-yum!\"",
