    "末日，末日已经开始了……": "The end... it's begun...",
    "末日……末日果然来了，一切都完了。": "The end's here... It really is. It's all over now.",
    "末日……末日要来了，没人能够逃掉。": "The end... it's coming! No one will escape...",
    末日的: "Apocalyptic",
    "末日将至啊……末日将至……": "The end draws near... it draws near...",
    末日求生套装: "Doomsday Survival Kit",
    陌生的卡戎: "Stranger Charon",
    陌生的信徒: "Unknown Follower",
    "莫非你的朋友是风精灵吗？": "Is your friend a wind faerie, by any chance?",
    "莫慌莫慌，我自是知道此地危险，但是我偏要来这旁人不敢涉足之地，点上一根沉月香给白龙神君，求他将烛阴之灾彻底扫除！": "No need to fret. I know it's dangerous — that's the point. I'm lighting a stick of Lunarose for Lord Argent right here, where only the brave venture, and begging Him to purge the Scourge of Zhuyin for good.",
    莫里斯: "Morris Glenville",
