    谋爱之人的肖像: "Portrait: The Love Seeker",
    谋爱之人的肖像·潮声: "Portrait: The Love Seeker - Tidewave",
    谋爱之人的肖像·誓约: "Portrait: The Love Seeker - Oath",
    "某人深深刻在墙上的文字拓本，用手拂过都能隐约感觉到刻字者的愤怒。": "A rubbing of words deeply etched into a wall with fierce emotion. The carver's anger behind each letter feels almost alive.",
    某位同盟成员的日记: "Some Forsakens Member's Journal",
    母亲的声音: "A Mother's Voice",
    "母神在落泪，她的孩子遍体鳞伤，匍匐于炽烈的炉火之中，向她哀求赦免。\n她要收回昔日所赐的喜乐与怜悯，将本为恩典的福分尽数取去。\n因他所行的恶不可赦免，他所犯的罪无可饶恕。\n母亲落下一滴泪，泪珠从她脸颊滑落，竟化为宝贵的晶石。\n\n——埃斯加特部落传说": "Mother Embla weeps. Her child, battered and bloodied, crawls through the blazing furnace, begging her for absolution.\nShe would reclaim the joy and mercy once bestowed, and strip away every blessing once granted by her grace.\nFor the evil he has wrought cannot be pardoned, nor the sins he bears forgiven.\nThen she sheds a single tear, and as it slips down her cheek, it hardens into a precious crystal.\n\n— A tribal legend from Askard",
    木梳: "Wooden Comb",
    "木头买来做什么？": "What do people buy timber for?",
    "木头提灯。": "The wooden lantern",
