    "祈请命运垂爱我等。": "We beseech fate to look kindly upon us.",
    "祈请命运垂爱我等。或者，向命运执起利剑。": "We beseech fate to look kindly upon us — or else raise our swords against it.",
    "骑乘[榛子]，获得100点[工作热情]。骑乘中，自身的移动速度提高，移动时对路径上的敌人造成风属性伤害。\n骑乘期间，无法使用武器，可以指挥[榛子]执行攻击。再次使用此技能时，退出骑乘状态并释放1次[蹄蹄小跑]。": "Truffle rides on [Filbert] and gains 100 points of [Passion For Work] and a Movement Speed boost, dealing Anemo Damage to enemies in the path when moving.\nWhen riding on [Filbert], Truffle is unable to use any weapon but can command [Filbert] to attack. When this skill is used again, Truffle dismounts and unleashes [Trotters Trot-Trot] once.",
    "骑乘[榛子]时，自身和队友背水提高#1，自身每2.0秒流失15.0%当前生命值并触发1次[蹄蹄小跑]的治疗及增益效果，有30.0%概率生成1个[活化嗅盐]或[凝神露滴]。作为协战伙伴出战时会施放[饱饱工作]。": "While Truffle is riding [Filbert], all team members gain #1 Resolve. Every 2.0s, Truffle loses 15.0% of her current HP, triggering one instance of [Trotters Trot-Trot]'s healing and buff effects and granting a 30.0% chance to generate 1 [Activated Sal Volatile] or [Tranquilizer Dewdrop]. When Truffle is deployed as a combat partner, she automatically casts [Tummy Full, Hands Full].",
    骑乘攻击二段伤害: "Filbert 2-Hit DMG",
