    "骑士们结伴离开了，你的眼前又只剩下延绵不绝的迷雾。": "The Knights depart together, leaving only endless mist before you.",
    琪知: "Qi Zhi",
    旗帜: "Flag",
    "乞丐……乞丐也有乞丐的生活追求。再说了，谁能拒绝一顿好吃的外卖呢？": "Er... beggars can have standards too. And really, who would say no to a decent meal brought straight to them?",
