    启蒙的: "Enlightened",
    启行指南: "Journey Guide",
    "起初华胥人说要给我做蛟毒鲶宴的时候我是拒绝的，甚至一度怀疑我是不是哪篇报道得罪了他们，让他们要用鱼来毒死我。但事后证明我完全想错了，口感顺滑，入口微麻，我以为是放了花椒，结果才知道这是毒液的缘故！华胥人到底是怎么把这种带毒的玩意做得这么好吃的！\n\n——卢卡美食记者 威姆，《寻味阿特拉西亚》": "When the people of Huaxu first told me they were preparing a Venomspine Catfish feast for me, I flat-out refused. For a moment, I wondered whether I'd slighted Huaxu cuisine in one of my pieces, and they meant to poison me with the fish. As it turned out, I was entirely mistaken. Silky-smooth, with a faint tingle on the tongue — I assumed they'd used peppercorns, only to learn it came from the venom itself. How do the Huaxu manage to make something poisonous taste this good!?\n\n— Wym, food journalist from Luca, A Taste of Atlasia",
    "起先，百年春只是诸多民间商会之一。但随着历史演变，它逐渐承担起了如同织星客行会一般的影响力。": "It began simply as one among many private trading guilds. Over time, however, it evolved into the principal organization that united all Starweavers.",
