    "侵吞帝国财产，跟我走一趟！": "Embezzling imperial property is a serious offence. You're coming with me!",
    秦执: "Qin Zhi",
    琴键上的: "Ivory-Keyed",
    勤奋的: "Diligent",
    "勤奋好学定是好事，但现在最紧要之事还是帮这位可怜的外乡客找到丢失的钱包，等我找到了再详细和你说说吧！": "Now that's what I like to hear! But first things first — let's help this poor traveller find her purse. Once I've found it, I'll tell you all about it.",
    青葱岁月: "Days of Spin",
    青鸾贰型: "Qingluan Type Ⅱ",
    "青年礼貌地向你致候。\n你看不到他的眼睛——他戴着一张尖锐的金属面具，完全覆盖了脸庞的上半部分。": "He greets you with quiet courtesy.\nYou cannot see his eyes — a sharp-edged mask of metal covers his face from brow to cheek.",
    "青年脸上的惊讶慢慢转变为钦佩。\n“那么……您是如何看待深渊的呢？您认为，人类会战胜它吗？”": "His surprise softens slowly into admiration.\n\"Then tell me — how do you see the Abyss? Do you believe mankind can prevail?\"",
    "青年也跟着走过来，神色颇有些惊讶。\n“阁下果然并非一般人物。您比我们更早进入深渊，究竟是如何做到保持意志坚定的？”": "Flynn follows, surprise plain upon his face.\n\"So it's true — you're no ordinary soul. You entered the Abyss before us... How have you endured so long?\"",
    "青年在篝火旁坐下，明亮的火焰映在他清澈的眼眸中。": "The young man settles by the campfire, flames dancing in his untainted eyes.",
    青青: "Qingqing",
    "青青子衿，悠悠我心，在这苍茫人世间，难道我真就无法找到相伴一生之人？": "Ah... my poor, lonely heart. In a world this vast, am I truly doomed to be alone forever?",
    青雀: "Qingque",
    "青铜淬炼机关骨，重棘归墟铸英魂。": "Bronze tempers the steel-born frame; amidst thorns, a soul forged for valour's claim.",
