    "清理一切污秽之物，驱赶所有不速之客，正是一位女仆的美德。": "Every stain must be cleansed, and every unexpected visitor driven out. Such is a maid's virtue.",
    清理杂物: "Clear away the clutter",
    清平乐: "Serene Joy",
    清平愿: "Wish for Tranquil Peace",
    清泉: "Spring Water",
    清扫整备: "Battle Cleanup",
    清商: "Qing Shang",
    清鸢: "Qing Yuan",
    "情感，对于每一个踏入军团的人来说，都是破绽罢了。": "Sentiment and feelings are merely weaknesses for anyone in the Legion.",
    "晴日将到来。": "Clear skies will come.",
    "晴天嘛，确实很适合洗晒，但是也意味着芙罗拉小姐和我的行迹更容易被注意到——对我来说，哪种天气都一样坏，只不过有的天气更坏一点而已。": "Sunny days do favour the laundry, yet they also make it easier for Miss Flora and me to be spotted. There's no ideal weather for us, just less troublesome days.",
    "擎天巨物的运转，离不开每一件齿轮的付出。": "Even the mightiest machine depends on every single cog.",
    "顷刻间，黑色的荆棘蔓延，吞噬了少年的身影。\n你轻轻地叹息一声，继续前进。": "In the blink of an eye, black thistles surge forth, swallowing the boy whole. \nYou let out a soft sigh... and press onward.",
    "请把这句箴言当作送来娃娃的谢礼吧。你很聪明，孩子，就像我所看到的一样……不需要我告诉你什么，你会依靠自己的力量探明疑问。": "Consider it a token of gratitude for bringing the doll. You are clever, as I've seen... You'll unravel the meaning on your own.",
    "请大家带好随身行李，提不动的呢就放在我们指定的寄存点，等下会有师傅帮咱们搬到入住的客栈内。": "Keep your valuables close, folks. Too heavy to lug around? Just pop your bags at the drop-off point and our porters will whisk them straight to your inns.",
    "请带上这束花吧，我们的祝福与你同在。": "Please, take these flowers. Our blessings go with you.",
    "请各位旅客确认行李中没有管制刀具、爆炸物等危险物品，有序排队候车……": "Passengers, please ensure that your luggage does not contain any prohibited items, including weapons, explosives, or other dangerous goods. Please queue in an orderly manner while waiting to board.",
    "请留步，很抱歉突然叫住您。": "Ah, pardon me! Forgive the sudden interruption.",
    "请你节哀……": "My condolences...",
    "请你离开这里，不要再来了。": "Please, just leave. Don't come back.",
    "请您务必小心，我在这里等您回来。": "Please be careful. I'll be waiting for you right here.",
    请求: "Pleading",
    "请听题！锦鲤皎皎的好友有三个皎皎朋友，第一个叫黄金皎皎，第二个叫白银皎皎，第三个叫什么？": "Right then, here's the question! A friend of Lunocarp's has three Luno friends. The first is called Lunogold, the second is Lunosilver — so what's the third one called?",
    "请听题！三人前后排队，各带帽子一顶，帽子颜色可能会出现红、黄、蓝其中一种。最后一人能看到前两人的帽子，中间的人只能看前面。最后一人沉默，接着中间人也沉默。第一人说自己戴黄帽。已知至少一人戴黄帽。下列哪个说法是正确的？": "Right then, here's the question! Three people are standing in a line, each wearing a hat that could be red, yellow, or blue. The one at the back can see the two hats ahead. The one in the middle can only see the hat of the person in front.\n At first, the person at the back stays quiet. And the one in the middle stays quiet too. And that's when the person at the front suddenly pipes up and says they're wearing a yellow hat.\n We also know at least one of the hats is yellow.\n So — which of these statements is correct?",
    "请听题！织星客丢了一件商品，经过调查找到了甲乙丙三人。甲指责：“是乙偷的！”。乙声称：“是丙偷的！”。丙说：“确实是我偷的！”。仅一人说了真话，请问到底是谁偷走了商品？": "Right then, here's the question! A Starweaver lost something from their stall, and they've narrowed it down to three suspects: A, B, and C.\n A says B stole it.\n B says C stole it.\n C admits it — says he's the guilty one.\n Only one of them is telling the truth... so who actually took it?",
    "请问你有在附近看到我掉的箱子吗？就普普通通的一个箱子，我找了半天都没找到。": "Excuse me, have you seen a chest I dropped around here? Just a plain chest. I've been looking forever.",
    "请问您是？": "So, may I ask who you are?",
    "请问这里有猫粮卖吗？": "Excuse me, do you sell cat food here?",
    庆典开始喽: "Let the Celebration Begin!",
    庆典漫游指南: "Parade Itinerary",
    "穷光蛋啊！": "This man has no money!",
    "茕茕之人，当汝沐浴于烈焰中，却甘愿只化为逐风的黄沙，此即为重生之刻。": "Thou, a solitary soul, standest at the heart of burning flame, yet dost willingly become but a grain of sand, swept by the winds of change. So begins thy rebirth, and the claiming of thy fate anew.",
