    囚鸟的刺羽的刀刃: "Chainbreak Pinion: Blade",
    囚鸟的刺羽的握柄: "Chainbreak Pinion: Grip",
    "求生的欲望使你们靠着本能在漫进船舱的冰冷海水中摸索，你好不容易护着心爱的那位找到了一艘救生艇。": "Panic sets in. Driven by instinct, you scramble through the freezing water flooding the cabins. You manage to protect your beloved and secure a lifeboat.",
    求知单片镜: "Monocle of Knowledge",
    "求助……天禄司？": "Ask... the Ministry of Fortune?",
    虬先生: "Mr Qiu",
    "虬先生……虬先生他不一样……": "Mr Qiu... he's different.",
    虬先生的投资: "Mr Qiu's Investment",
    "虬先生叫你来的？怎么可能？不是说了尘漠石海区域只由我一人来负责就好吗？来之前还说的……什么什么，无甚旧史，不必细考的……": "He did? That can't be right. He said the Gritblight Expanse was my brief alone. Before I left he even said— what was it — \"no old records, nothing worth digging into,\" or something along those lines.",
    "虬先生就是黑市里开出的荷花！出淤泥而不染，他能在这大染缸之中自保，并混出了自己的名头，已经很了不起了，你这种小孩不会理解的。": "Mr Qiu's like a lotus rising from the muck — pure and untouched by the filth around him! To stay that clean in a place like this, and still make a name for himself... remarkable, truly remarkable. You're too young to understand.",
    "虬先生可不是一般的投资人，卢卡的百年沉船、艾利西安的千年遗迹、海伯利亚的战争遗址等等考古学重大发现都是他亲自找到的。": "Mr Qiu isn't just some investor. He is the investor who uncovered the century-sunken ships in the Republic of Luca, the ruins in Elysium buried for thousands of years, and the battlefield in Hyperborea lost to time. Each stands a milestone in the annals of archaeology.",
    "虬先生是大才，无论是生意场还是收藏界，他可都是鼎鼎有名的人物。不止如此，和他相处时的感觉也让人舒服，他总能洞察你真实的需求。": "He's a man of real talent — everyone in business, every collector worth his salt, knows his name. More than that, he's a pleasure to deal with — it's like he sees straight through you.",
    "虬先生是大陆考古协会的总投资人，更是一名伟大的考古学家与大收藏家。甚至还有传言说他是行走在华胥“阴影”中的君主……": "Mr Qiu is the chief investor of Archaeological Society, as well as a renowned archaeologist and collector. Whispers persist that he is none other than a sovereign who walks within the \"shadow\" of Huaxu.",
    "虬先生意味深长地看着你微笑，似乎还有什么话想说，去看看他葫芦里卖的什么药吧。": "Mr Qiu watches you go with a knowing smile, as if he still has something to say. Go back and see what he's up to.",
    球球豚: "Pufferball",
    球球豚·异种: "Pufferball Variant",
    "区域联机将于夜航篇第一章主线任务“二次诞生”推进至进入冰湖城阶段后开启。前往冰湖城广场参与联机，获赠好礼。": "Co-op areas unlock once you reach Icelake in Noctoyager Arc: Chapter 1 – The Reborn. Go to Icelake Square to participate in co-op activities and earn rewards.",
    驱黯的巡游: "Shadow Banisher",
    驱动组件: "Propulsion Unit",
    驱离: "Expulsion",
    "驱邪退恶，破煞消灾。": "Let evil find no foothold; let misfortune be kept at bay.",
    驱逐: "Termination",
    驱逐·一: "Termination (Ⅰ)",
