    "取得“调停”委托的胜利，且击败所有神弃者同盟的首领": "Complete any [Commission: Mediation] after defeating all Forsaken bosses",
    "取得“调停”委托的胜利，且没有击败任何一位神弃者同盟的首领": "Complete any [Commission: Mediation] without defeating any Forsaken bosses",
