    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·炼火的典狱长”的胜利，且未召唤协战同伴": "Secured victory in \"Nocturnal Echoes · The Warden of the Inferno\" on the highest difficulty without summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·炼火的典狱长”的胜利，未受到生命值伤害且未召唤协战同伴": "Secured victory in \"Nocturnal Echoes · The Warden of the Inferno\" on the highest difficulty without losing HP or summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·嗜晶者”的胜利，且未召唤协战同伴": "Secure victory in [Nocturnal Echoes: Crystalophile] on the highest difficulty without summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·嗜晶者”的胜利，未受到伤害且未召唤协战同伴": "Secure victory in [Nocturnal Echoes: Crystalophile] on the highest difficulty without losing HP or summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·西比尔”的胜利，且未召唤协战同伴": "Secure victory in [Nocturnal Echoes: Sibylle] on the highest difficulty without summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·西比尔”的胜利，未受到伤害且未召唤协战同伴": "Secure victory in [Nocturnal Echoes: Sibylle] on the highest difficulty without losing HP or summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·雪国的野兽”的胜利，且未召唤协战同伴": "Secured victory in \"Nocturnal Echoes: Beast From the Snowfield\" on the highest difficulty without summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·雪国的野兽”的胜利，未受到生命值伤害且未召唤协战同伴": "Secured victory in \"Nocturnal Echoes: Beast From the Snowfield\" on the highest difficulty without losing HP or summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·羽化者”的胜利，且未召唤协战同伴": "Secure victory in [Nocturnal Echoes: The Eclosioner] on the highest difficulty without summoning any Combat Partners",
    "取得最高难度“梦魇残声·羽化者”的胜利，未受到伤害且未召唤协战同伴": "Secure victory in [Nocturnal Echoes: The Eclosioner] on the highest difficulty without losing HP or summoning any Combat Partners",
    取回狩月人遗失的物品: "Retrieve the lost items for the forgetful Phoxhunter",
    取消: "Cancel",
    "去。": "Yes, please.",
    "去“闹鬼”的仓库看看": "Check out the \"haunted\" warehouse",
    "去吧，保持联络，听我指示。": "Go, stay in touch, and be careful.",
    "去吧，带着这份乐观，保持脸上的笑容，去把乐观传递给更多人吧！": "Go forth! Take this joy with you, keep that smile plastered on your face, and spread the good word to everyone you meet!",
    "去过。": "I have.",
    去看看孤独的野猫: "Check on the lonely stray",
    "去你*的，你别见个卡戎就讹人好吗？": "Oh, piss off. You can't just pin it on the first Charon you see.",
    "去你*的吧！我才不稀罕你们这种人的施舍！整天一副假惺惺的样子，见到穿着破烂的小孩也要把手上的东西丢出来。": "Oh, f*** off! I don't need your charity! Always swanning about like you're better than the rest of us, chucking scraps to slum kids like that makes you a bloody saviour.",
    "去年百花车站敬业标兵选拔赛，我曾荣获第一名，这是车站所有人对我的鼓励与期许，我为这份荣誉感到骄傲。": "I was named Employee of the Year last year. I'm proud of that. Means the work I do here counts for something.",
    "去年修书一封，邀你去家乡做客，我给你打树上的核桃来吃，你只说你生了病，后续我忙起别事，竟是忘了这茬。": "Last year, I wrote to invite you back to my hometown. I promised I'd knock walnuts down from the trees for you myself. But you wrote back saying you were unwell. Then other things got in the way... and before I knew it, it slipped my mind.",
    "去泉通阁问过了吗？奉香大典前事务繁杂，那批拨款要早点讨过来才好做事。": "Have you asked at the Hall of Founts? It's always hectic before the Grand Incense Rite. Best to chase that allocation up early, or you won't get much done.",
    "去他*的机遇！留在你身边才是我该做的事情！": "I don't care about any of that! What matters to me is being with you!",
    去幽明涧看看发生了什么: "Visit Twilight Ravine to see what's going on",
    "去追一只鹿，将它献给兔妈妈，亲爱如母亲；\n去追一只鹿，将它献给兔妈妈，敬爱如神祇；\n取下它分裂的双蹄，割去它不驯的犄角；\n教训它的顽冥不灵！\n剥去那柔软的皮，用针线缝起；\n在石子遍布的小路上，铺满鹿皮。\n兔妈妈，请你来到这里！\n伸出仁爱的手心，\n于<H>金鹿</>的见证下，\n赐予我第二次生命。\n\n——《兔妈妈颂歌·猎鹿之章》": "Chase a deer and bring it to Mother Bunny, dear as a mother;\nChase a deer and bring it to Mother Bunny, sacred as a god.\nTake its cloven hooves, cut away its defiant horns;\nTeach its stubborn heart to yield.\nPeel the soft hide, stitch it with thread and bone;\nSpread the skin across the stony road.\nMother Bunny, come to us!\nReach out your gentle hand—\nUnder the gaze of the <H>Golden Deer</>—\nGrant me a second life.\n\n— Hymn to Mother Bunny: The Deer Hunt",
    全部: "All",
    全部类型: "All Types",
    "全城的香炉都要仔细查验香料储备，尤其是中心广场水上的那个炉子，务必不能有疏漏。": "Inspect the incense reserves in every censer across the city. Be thorough. Pay special attention to the one on the water in the central square. Don't miss a thing.",
    全村的希望Ⅰ: "The Pride of the City Ⅰ",
    全村最好的剑Ⅰ: "The Best Sword Ⅰ",
    全村最好的枪Ⅰ: "The Best Gun Ⅰ",
    全村最后的希望: "The Last Resort",
    全副武装的士兵: "Fully Armed Soldier",
    "全家欢天喜地把这些鱼给煮了，府上也没有盐巴，就白水煮了，但毕竟是少爷新钓的，竟是一点也没有腥气……": "We were so happy. We boiled the catch right then and there. We'd no salt, just plain water, but because they were fresh from the hook, they didn't taste fishy at all...",
    "全身包裹着火焰，生活在炎热地区的魔灵。正因如此，才让它总是散发着一股淡淡的烤肉焦香。": "Wreathed in flames and native to scorching regions, this fiery Geniemon leaves a faint whiff of grilled meat wherever it goes.",
    全神贯注: "Rapt Attention",
