    "三年涝灾，曾经好好的堤坝坍塌，庄稼被淹，你可知，你可知！可知多少家庭毁于一旦？！": "My hometown used to be rich and fertile. After that accident, we had flooding for three straight years. The embankments gave way, and the crops were washed away. Do you have any idea how many families lost everything overnight!?",
