    "桑的部族产出的蚕丝质量优异，很快远近闻名，之后便有织星客不远千里来到锦云谷收购，并带来了大风九章的消息。": "The silk from Sang's tribe was top-notch, famous far and wide. It wasn't long before Starweavers travelled thousands of miles to buy it, bringing news of the Nine Chapters of Dafeng with them.",
    桑尼: "Sunny",
    "桑拥有与草木共鸣的魔法，在觉醒后，她很快带领氏族将锦云谷一代危害一方的秽兽诛杀，并利用自己的天赋教习部族内的普通人养蚕。": "Sang possessed magic that resonated with nature itself. After she awakened, she led her people to wipe out the Filthoids plaguing the area. Then, she used her gifts to teach the common folk how to raise silkworms.",
