    "沙洲先生是华胥历史上赫赫有名的香官，在其之前，悬衡派的分香术仅仅只有天才才能修行，更别说勤加练习。": "Mr. Shazhou is a legendary incense warden in the annals of Huaxu. Before his time, Incense Discernment was an esoteric art reserved for geniuses. Mere diligence was never enough to master it.",
