    "莎莉婶婶似乎是因某位夫人的事情感到烦恼，遇见这位夫人的话，或许可以留意一下。": "Ms Sally seems to be worrying about a lady she cares for. If you encounter this lady, you can perhaps help her out.",
    "傻孩子还不知道发生了什么，见那血流了三尺，围观者无不尖叫呼救，他只意味站在原地拍手傻乐。": "The poor soul didn't even understand. There was blood everywhere, people screaming for help... and he just stood there, clapping his hands and giggling.",
    "傻子才做呢，哈哈！我看啊，要做的是先把这些不守规矩的家伙们全清空。": "Only a fool would! Ha! When it gets like that, best thing to do's toss out the lot who won't play by the rules.",
