    "山有木兮木有枝，心悦君兮……唔！没有没有，那批委托是我给自己下的，才不是要送给他……": "Trees grace the mountain, boughs grace every tree; and in my heart... there is only you... Ah! No, that's not what I meant! I'm asking for myself. It has nothing to do with him...",
