    "闪避时，生成1个[鳞粉]领域，对其中的敌人每秒造成<Highlight>400.0%</>角色攻击的伤害。效果每<Highlight>5.0</>秒最多触发1次。": "Dodging spawns a [Powder] field, dealing damage equal to <Highlight>400.0%</> of Character ATK per second to enemies inside. Can trigger once every <Highlight>5.0</>s.",
