    "伤害暴击后，获得1层触发概率提高#1，持续5.0秒，最多叠加5.0层。": "When dealing CRIT damage, gains 1 stack that increases Trigger Probability by #1 for 5.0s, up to 5.0 stacks.",
    "伤害暴击后，有#1概率将目标缴械。": "When dealing CRIT Damage, there is a #1 chance to disarm the target.",
