    "伤害触发额外效果后，获得1层多重射击提高#1，持续10.0秒，最多叠加5.0层。": "When triggering Bonus Effect, gains 1 stack that increases Multishot by #1 for 10.0s, up to 5.0 stacks.",
    "伤害触发额外效果后，获得1层攻击范围提高#1，持续10.0秒，最多叠加2.0层。": "When triggering Bonus Effect, gains 1 stack that increases ATK Range by #1 for 10.0s, up to 2.0 stacks.",
    "伤害触发震荡额外效果后，获得1层暴击伤害提高#1，持续10.0秒，最多叠加10.0层。": "When triggering Bonus Effect: Smash, gains 1 stack that increases CRIT Damage by #1 for 10.0s, up to 10.0 stacks.",
    "伤害降低，通过一定层后解除该效果并获得余烬。": "Loses Damage Dealt. Clear a set number of depths to remove this effect and gain Embers.",
