    神智: "Sanity",
    "神智百分比较低时，每秒回复神智。": "Restores Sanity per second when Sanity is low.",
    "神智百分比较低时，受到伤害降低。": "Decreases DMG Taken when Sanity is low.",
    "神智百分比下降至<Highlight>50.0%</>以下时，在<Highlight>5.0</>秒内每秒回复<Highlight>12.0</>点神智，效果每<Highlight>20.0</>秒最多触发1次。": "Restores Sanity by <Highlight>12.0</> per second every <Highlight>5.0</>s when Sanity drops below <Highlight>50.0%</>. This effect can only be triggered once every <Highlight>20.0</>s.",
    "神智百分比小于<Highlight>50.0%</>时，受到的伤害降低<Highlight>30.0%</>。": "Decreases Damage Taken by <Highlight>30.0%</> when Sanity drops below <Highlight>50.0%</>.",
    神智回复: "Sanity Recovery",
    神智消耗: "Sanity Cost",
    "神智自然恢复量提高，生命百分比较低时效果更强。": "Increases Sanity Auto-Recovery. The effect intensifies at lower HP.",
    "神智自然恢复量提高。": "Increases Sanity Auto-Recovery.",
    "神智自然恢复量提高<Highlight>3.0</>点。": "Sanity Auto-Recovery +<Highlight>3.0</>.",
    "神智自然恢复量提高<Highlight>4.0</>点。": "Sanity Auto-Recovery +<Highlight>4.0</>.",
