    "甚好，那便继续温书去吧！": "Splendid. Off you go then. Back to your books!",
    "甚是喧嚣……·迷津": "Quite the Racket...: Mystic Maze",
    "甚是喧嚣……Ⅰ": "Quite the Racket... Ⅰ",
