    "师傅，我就是想来问问，这炉灶为何总是出问题，我这几番叨扰，自己都有点过意不去了。": "Any idea why this burner keeps acting up? Sorry to trouble you again, but it won't behave.",
    "师傅你是做什么的？": "What do you do?",
    "师兄，你终于愿意回来看看了！": "Shixiong — you're finally back to visit!",
    "师兄，我和你说啊，昨天我在山外山附近看到一只大红狐狸窜过去，嗬，那一身毛啊，油光水滑的！你说，它会不会就是咱们一起养过的小橙子？": "Shixiong, listen — yesterday, out by the gates of the Outer Peaks, I saw a big red fox dash past. That coat — slick and glossy as lacquer! You reckon it could've been Little Tangerine? The one we used to feed?",
    诗歌段落: "Verse",
    诗人: " Poet",
    "诗人边唱着，边落下泪来。他终于从遥远的历史，唱到了眼前的现在——这片幽暗的深渊。\n不知从何时起，传颂会两千年来最神圣洁净的圣湖，一夜之间突然为这污浊的混沌所取代。\n就像一千年前那些弃教的堕落者所言的那样——“九神已死！”\n要继续听下去吗？": "The bard sings, and tears fall. The theme of his song has shifted from distant glory to the vile gloom before your eyes.\nNo one knows exactly when it began. But one night, without warning, the Sacred Lake — purest and holiest to the Elysian faithful for two thousand years — was devoured by the Abyss.\nAnd just as the apostates once said a thousand years ago: \"The Great Nine are dead!\" \nWill you keep listening?",
    "诗人的夜晚总是漫长……剧作家也不例外！我们的笔书写着人间的脉动，我们的心自然也与潮汐和月亮为伴！": "Nights can be particularly long for poets... and playwrights! Our pens track the vibe amongst people, and our hearts naturally rise and fall with the moon and tide!",
    "诗人向你伸手，飞扬的烟灰如风暴般瞬间侵占了你全部的视野。\n当烟灰散去，诗人早已不知所踪。": "The poet reaches out — embers surge like a tempest, swallowing your vision whole.\nWhen the ash settles, only silence remains.",
    "诗人用指尖残留的烟灰在你的手心写下了什么。\n你依旧无法理解这些文字的含义，但你能感觉到它鲜明的温度，热烈却不至于将人灼伤。\n当你再次抬头，诗人已经不知所踪。": "With the last of the ash upon her fingertip, the poet inscribes something upon your palm.\nYou cannot read the symbols, but their warmth feels vivid and ardent — and yet not burning in the least.\nWhen you look up again, she is gone.",
    "诗人再次伸手搅动篝火，纤细的指尖在火焰中穿梭，灵动如同舞者的双足。": "The poet reaches into the fire again, slender fingers weaving through flames like a performer's nimble feet.",
    "施放[濯暗鳞]时，获得6枚[逆鳞]。": "Yuming gains 6 [Reverse Scales] when using [Grimscales].",
    "施放技能时，向前方区域释放3波落雷，每道落雷对命中敌人造成<Highlight>350.0%</>角色攻击的雷属性伤害。冷却时间<Highlight>6.0</>秒。": "Upon using a skill, calls down 3 waves of bolts ahead, each dealing Electro DMG equal to <Highlight>350.0%</> of Character ATK to enemies on hit. Cooldown: <Highlight>6.0</>s.",
    "施放技能时，向前方区域释放落雷，对命中敌人造成雷属性伤害。": "Upon using a skill, unleashes lightning strikes ahead, dealing Electro DMG to enemies on hit.",
