    狩月纪念币: "Phoxcoin",
    狩月人: " Phoxhunter",
    "狩月人，您务必要小心，您的安危才是第一位的。我在这里等待您顺利归来。": "Phoxhunter, please take care. Your safety is our utmost priority. I'll remain here and await your return.",
    "狩月人，我成啦！": "Phoxhunter, I did it! I've become a train!",
    "狩月人？你来得正好，这批建材不小心掉轨道上了，你能帮我一起清理下吗？": "A Phoxhunter? Just in time. A batch of building materials has accidentally fallen onto the tracks. Could you help me clear them away?",
    "狩月人？你来得正好，最近公路下面结的冰锥有点多了，一起把它们清理掉吧。": "A Phoxhunter? Perfect timing. The icicles forming under the bridge are becoming a serious hazard. Mind lending a hand with the clearing?",
    "狩月人……哦，是海伯利亚那边的算是赏金猎人的职业？这委托都接到国外来了，还真是敬业。如果有麻烦可以跟我说，说不定我能帮上忙。": "Phoxhunter... right, that bounty-hunter sort of job from Hyperborea? Travelling abroad for work — that's dedication. If you run into trouble, just say the word. I might be able to help.",
    狩月人·协战: "Phoxhunter: Assist",
    狩月人·阵亡: "Phoxhunter: Fallen",
    "狩月人啊，我需要点莲草做鱼饵，但莲草都在湖对面我过不去啊，你能帮我采点回来吗？": "Hey, Phoxhunter! I'm in a bit of a pickle — I need some Eclipta Grass for bait, but it's across the lake. Could you fetch some for me?",
    狩月人的第一步: "Phoxhunter 101",
    狩月人的肖像: "Portrait: Phoxhunter",
    狩月人联盟: "The League of Phoxhunters",
    "狩月人你来啦，我怀疑这地方今天根本没有鱼，你能不能帮我试试？": "Oh hey, Phoxhunter! Glad I ran into you. I'm starting to think this lake's fish-free. Mind giving it a go?",
    "狩月人是你啊，我的鱼线被下面几块垃圾缠住了，你能帮帮我吗？": "Oh! A Phoxhunter! Thank the stars — my line's tangled around some junk down there. Mind breaking it loose for me?",
    "狩月人完成PC端及移动端登录后，可获得头像框·静谧香炉和纯白沙漏等奖励。": "Log in on both PC and mobile to receive rewards, including the Silent Censer avatar frame and Pristine Hourglasses.",
    狩月人形象礼箱·不羁: "Phoxhunter Skin Chest – Untamed",
    狩月人形象礼箱·匆匆: "Phoxhunter Skin Chest – Fleeting Traces",
