    书瑶: "Shuyao",
    叔柏: "Shubai",
    "叔叔，这是什么？看着好可爱，可以送给我吗？": "Sir, what's that? It's so cute! Can I have it?",
    "殊不知制香的本源该是取自天地，以敬天地。": "What they fail to understand is that incense begins with gifts taken from Heaven and Earth, and so Heaven and Earth must in turn be met with due reverence.",
    疏通水道: "Sewer Maintenance Duty",
    输出: "DPS",
    "输了，那就独自承受后果。活不活得下来，活下来又当如何，与他人无关。": "Lose, and you bear the cost yourself. Whether you survive, and what you choose to do afterwards — that's no one else's concern.",
    "输了要赔钱？": "And if you lose, you pay?",
