    "投资我吧！{性别：老爷|小姐}，我没有什么能给你的，只有我的真心，我的仇恨！": "Would you invest in me, {性别：sir|miss}? I've got nothing left to offer but my heart... and the will to make that bastard pay!",
    "骰子落下前，无人知晓自己将满载而归，还是一无所有。": "Toss it. Trust it. Try again when it ruins your life.",
