    兔死谁手: "Who Claims the Rabbit",
    "推荐嘛……真要是说，其实还真没有，这东市近些年改换得面目一新，以往熟悉的老店要不关了门要不搬了地址。": "Hmm... truth be told, not really. East Market's changed beyond recognition these past few years. The old shops we knew have either shut down or moved elsewhere.",
    "腿上磕到了，乌青一大截，老年人本就骨头脆，现在已经在床上躺着了。": "Taken a nasty knock to the leg, she has. Bruised black and blue. At her age, bones are brittle. She hasn't been able to leave her bed since.",
    退避: "Sidestep",
    "退出[借相]状态，对面前范围内的敌人造成光属性伤害。": "Ends [Aspect Manifestation] state and deals Lumino Damage to enemies in front.",
    "退一万步说，在人家办事处门口宣传这些也不合适吧……": "Even if you mean well, it's a bit much to be hawking that right outside the offices...",
    蜕生者: "Eclosis",
    吞噬之根: "Devouring Roots",
    托德: "Todd",
    托兰: "Toran",
    "托您的福，食物和燃料，我总能得到其中一个，人生就是一场取舍。": "Your concern is appreciated. I can either afford enough food or fuel. Guess for some people, having it all isn't an option.",
    "拖延时间想溜？兄弟们，给我看着这{性别：小子|丫头}，看紧点。": "Trying to stall and slip away, huh? Everyone, keep a close eye on this kid. Don't let {性别:him|her} get away.",
    陀螺: " Whirlwind",
    "陀螺因你旋转。": "For you, the DNA keeps spinning.",
    "挖到了，给。": "Found it, here you go.",
    挖掘: "Excavate",
    "娃儿，你又来啦，来找我聊天还是侃大山？": "Ah, you're back, kiddo. Got questions in that head of yours, or just here to shoot the breeze with an old carpenter?",
    "娃儿，我得把这块烂木头先锯下来，你且先让让，不然噪声大，吵着耳朵聋。": "Best step back, kiddo. I need to saw off this rotten bit — noisy work. Don't want you going half-deaf on my account.",
    "娃儿看着面生，不像是咱们皓京本地的，是来这东市买些啥？纪念之物，还是别的？": "Don't think I've seen you before, child. You're not from Haojing, are you? Here to pick up a souvenir, perhaps?",
    "娃儿在说什么胡话呢？我不常来这里了，我家那老头子才是经常来，他喜欢热闹，回回肉菜都不从西市买，非要绕一圈过来。": "What are you on about, child? I don't come here much these days. It was my old man who was always here — he loved the bustle. Whenever he went out to buy meat and veg, he'd make a detour and come here instead of going to West Market.",
    "娃儿这都看得出来啊，我以前是在机枢派学过些时日，但我对那会动的木头娃娃确实不感兴趣，我就喜欢琢磨钻研那不会动的东西。": "Sharp eyes, kiddo. Aye, I trained with the Jishu for a spell, but I never cared much for those walking wooden dolls. I've always liked things that stay still while you're carving them.",
    "娃娃，别这么说，人生很长的，没过完最后一天之前，谁知道明天会去哪里呢？": "Don't say that. Life is long. Until your last day comes, who knows where your feet might take you tomorrow?",
    "娃娃，你别紧张，华胥可没什么坏人，只是我这有一瓶新酿好的酒，想让你品鉴一番。": "Easy, kid. Huaxu's not the sort of place that attracts shady types. I've just brewed a new jug and wanted someone to give it a taste.",
    "娃娃不说话，只是继续笑，那笑声在空旷的夜里越听越瘆人，他也越来越想跑，直到最后，娃娃才说道：": "The child didn't answer, just kept laughing. The sound grew more chilling in the empty night, and the watchman wanted nothing more than to leg it. Finally, the child spoke:",
    "娃娃聪慧！所以老夫绝无别心，这瓶香料酒，是我专程收的圆糯米，蒸制时加入玉桂，带出一丝温润的甜香，再加青砖红提香增味。": "Sharp kid! Exactly. Nothing dodgy. As for this spiced rice wine, I used a special sticky rice, steamed it with cinnamon for a warm sweetness, then added tea leaves to lift the aroma and round out the flavour.",
    "娃娃娃娃，快过来！": "Oi, kid! You there!",
    "娃娃哟~我说什么来着？你这不是回来看我了吗？": "Ah, you're back, dear~ See? I knew you'd come back for me.",
    瓦解: "Dissolution",
    瓦解符石: "Rune: Collapse",
    瓦伦: "Valen",
    "哇，爸爸真的好厉害！": "Whoa! You're amazing, Daddy!",
    "哇，看你的打扮，是位很厉害的狩月人吧！那个……我其实也是狩月人，只是我太弱了……": "Wow, judging by your gear, you must be a really skilled Phoxhunter, right? Actually... I'm a Phoxhunter myself, but I'm not very strong...",
    "哇，没想到你找到了这么多箱子呀，那我就先拿走我掉的普通箱子了哈，谢谢你！": "Whoa — you actually found this many chests? I'll just take my own one, then. Thank you!",
    "哇，那我可真是太伤心了。": "Wow, that would really break my heart.",
    "哇，你很懂嘛。": "Haha, you really get it.",
    "哇，商户们工作得好认真！": "Blimey, everyone's working so hard!",
    "哇，是幽灵！": "Whoa, It's a Ghost!",
    "哇，原来是铁匠前辈啊！": "Wow! So you're an experienced master blacksmith!",
    "哇，这么快就被你找到了。": "Wow, that was quick!",
    "哇，真的，谢谢。": "Wow... Thank you... truly...",
    "哇！！！": "Waaah!!!",
    "哇！白龙神君果然和画像上的那些不一样，那他是怎么在云上飞的呢？是踩着一片云朵吗？还是直接就——呜~地飞走了。": "Wow! So they really are different from the pictures! But how do they fly, then? Do they step on a cloud? Or do they just go whoosh — and vanish into the sky?",
    "哇！听起来好厉害啊，那姑母，沈书生现在在哪里？": "Cor! That sounds brilliant! Where's Shen now, Auntie?",
    "哇！听起来很厉害，不过所有的粮秣专员的工作都是这样的吗？": "Wow! That sounds impressive. Is it the same for all commissaries?",
    "哇！怎么想都好厉害，{性别：大哥哥|大姐姐}，要是我有一天也长出角，你可不可以教我这种很厉害的魔法！": "Wow! That sounds amazing! {性别：Sir|Miss}, if my horns grow, will you teach me that magic?",
    "哇！这个好厉害！我也想要！": "Wow! That's amazing! I want one too!",
    "哇！真的吗！那你能不能告诉我，白龙神君究竟长什么样子呀？": "Wow! Really? Please, you have to tell me what Lord Argent looks like!",
    "哇啊啊，小仆从，苏乙身上又散发出那种不近人情的老师气场了！好吓人！": "Whoa! Little minion, she's giving off that scary teacher vibe again! So intimidating!",
    "哇呀呀呀！大胆飘零人，以武犯禁！屡教不改！": "Oi! You shameless Drifter! Waving weapons about in open defiance of the law! You lawless wretch!",
    "歪理一堆，举证也不清晰，我不与你辩了。": "That is a flawed analogy and a weak argument. I'm done wasting my breath on you.",
    外地商人: "Foreign Merchant",
