    "完成任意狩月人委托（可通过委托界面接取）": "Complete any Phoxhunter Commission \n(Can accept this commission via the Commission page)",
    完成赛跑: "Complete the race",
    "完成手记任务时获得的道具，用于获得每日奖励。\n记录在册的事项既有长远的目标，也有日常的琐事。它们记录着每一次成长，让每一分努力都变得有迹可循。": "Earned by completing daily tasks. Use it to claim your daily reward.\nFrom grand quests to the simplest errands, each mark brings you closer to your goal — proof that no effort goes unnoticed.",
    "完成狩月人小队排名赛的证明。在狩月人之间被视作荣誉的象征。": "Proof of participating in the Apex Rankings — a mark of honour among Phoxhunters.",
    "完成松露与榛子对应的委托密函，获取松露与榛子的思绪片段": "Complete [Truffle and Filbert]'s Covert Commission to obtain their Thoughts",
    "完成特殊支线任务“魔灵啊魔灵”、“教学任务：委托密函”后，可获得包括道具“思绪片段·松露与榛子”在内的奖励。": "Complete the special Side Quests \"Go, Geniemons!\" and \"Tutorial: Covert Commissions\" to earn rewards, including \"Thought: Truffle and Filbert\".",
    "完成委托密函：松露与榛子": "Complete Covert Commission: [Truffle and Filbert]",
    完成物资回收: "Recover the supplies",
    完成一次避险委托: "Complete Commission: Hedge once",
