    "完成主线任务“俯瞰者们”获取包括道具“思绪片段·达芙涅”在内的任务奖励。": "Complete the Main Story \"The Overlookers\" to claim your Quest Rewards, including the [Thought: Daphne].",
    "完成主线任务“猎物与猎人”获取包括道具“思绪片段·奥特赛德”在内的任务奖励。": "Complete the Main Story \"Prey VS Hunter\" to claim your Quest Rewards, including the [Thought: Outsider].",
