    "五光十色一尾姗，锦鳞弄水是斑斓。\n独游可堪倾城色，成双立为陷阵甲。\n\n——佚名《斑斓舞衣赞》": "In dazzling hues, it weaves through tide,\nIridescent scales in ripples glide.\nIn solitude — a beauty unmatched, serene.\nIn pairs — all grace gives way to spite unseen.\n\n— Nameless poet, Ode to the Iridescentscale",
    "五六年的交情了，当年要不是他给了我一块面包，我也早就死了。我不想他死。": "We've known each other five, maybe six years... Back then, if he hadn't given me a piece of bread, I'd be dead already. I don't want anything to happen to him.",
    "五禽戏分为五种姿势，动作都是从华胥本土的动物身上学来的。": "There are five forms in all, each based on an animal native to Huaxu.",
    "五禽戏是哪五禽？": "Which five animals are they?",
    "五味万殊，而大同于美；曲变虽众，亦大同于和；子性各异，但大同于敏；教术众多，然大同于情。": "Flavours may differ a thousand ways, yet all tend towards the good. Tunes may change without end, yet all return to harmony. The young may vary in temperament, yet all share a quickness of wit. Methods of teaching may be many, yet all come back to the heart.",
    "午餐吃完想着好不容易能歇一会了，结果又有人端来一大盘点心和水果，好不容易吃完又到了晚餐时间。": "After lunch I think, \"Finally, a break\" — but no, someone appears with a huge tray of pastries and fruit. Finish that, and it's supper already.",
