    雾海来客: "Visitor from the Misty Sea",
    "雾海是一切的原点。圣树自雾海生长，天之树是它庞大的枝叶，世界则立于圣树之上。": "The Misty Sea is the origin of all things. From it rose the Sacred Tree. Its canopy stretched across the heavens — and each of its branches became a Heaventree. Its roots, meanwhile, cradled the world.",
    "雾海是一切生者的来处与归途。万物归于雾海，雾海又孕育新的万物……就像死去的云滴落泥土，鲜花又自泥土中盛开。": "The Misty Sea is the birthplace and final rest of all living beings. To the Misty Sea, the deceased return, and from there, life begins anew... just as dying clouds dissolve into the earth as rain, only for flowers to bloom again from that very soil.",
