    "西奥，这位年纪轻轻的研究者（自称的）渴望了解卡戎的方方面面，而你，就是他所选定的第一位实验对象。": "Theo — a self-proclaimed young researcher — is eager to study everything about the Charon. Lucky you, you've been chosen as his very first case study.",
