    心有余悸的大叔: "Shaken Middle-aged Man",
    心脏吞噬: "Heart Devourer",
    "心之忧矣，于我归处。": "My heart is heavy with sorrow — where, then, is my way home?",
    "辛苦了，货就在那边的船上。": "Thanks. The goods are on that boat over there.",
    "辛苦了，他今天这个问题应该选第二个。": "Cheers. For today's question, go with the second option.",
    "辛苦了，他今天这个问题应该选第三个。": "Cheers. For today's question, go with the third option.",
    "辛苦了，他今天这个问题应该选第一个。": "Cheers. For today's question, go with the first option.",
    "辛苦你了，年轻人，冰湖城的治安，以后只能靠你和我了啊。": "You did good, kid. The safety of Icelake rests on shoulders like ours.",
    "辛苦你了，这是说好的报酬。": "Thanks for the help. Here's your cut.",
    "新的国度，新的传说。": "A new land. A new legend.",
    "新的世界，新的开始。": "A world anew, beginnings untold.",
    "新发明的——老鼠永动机，海伯利亚的未来还得看我吧！": "My latest invention... the Rat-Powered Perpetual Motion Machine. Hyperborea's future is standing right in front of you!",
    "新面孔……看过来了！": "Ah... they're looking this way!",
    新人玩家: "First-Time Player",
    "新手狩月人的第一桶金。": "A novice Phoxhunter's first taste of fortune.",
    新手训练竿: "Training Rod",
    新天地: "Brand New World",
    "新鲜逐汐鱼可以生食，鱼肉的鲜活可以顺着你的牙齿涌进你的大脑，仿佛能看到它跃动的尾巴，感到它横穿海洋的魄力。品味过这口珍馐后，很多人都发出了同样的感慨——生命在于运动啊！\n\n——美食家 艾森斯，《好吃，爱吃，会吃》": "Fresh Tidechaser is best eaten raw. The taste doesn't just hit your tongue — it shoots straight from your teeth to your brain. In that moment, you feel the flick of its tail, the ocean parting in its wake. And most who are lucky enough to try it, without fail, say the same thing: \"You can really taste the life in it!\"\n\n— Ethans, food critic, Eat It, Love It, Know It",
    "新型机傀？": "A new mechapuppet?",
    新秀: " Rising Star",
