    "休息？": "...Unwind?",
    休息二式: "Resting Stance Ⅱ",
    "休息好了吗？": "Ready to get started?",
    "休息完毕后，她随手摘下一朵红花，起身时发现花丛的另一端也站起了一位年轻人，而那名年轻人手中，则捧着一朵白花。": "When she got up, she plucked a red flower, and on the other side of the patch, a young man also stood up, holding a white flower in his hand.",
    休息一式: "Resting Stance Ⅰ",
    休息一下: "Take a break",
    休止符: "Fermata",
    "修复[灯盖·荣誉赐福]1次": "Light up 1 node(s) of [Lantern Lid: Blessing of Glory]",
    "修复[灯盖·荣誉赐福]24次": "Light up 24 node(s) of [Lantern Lid: Blessing of Glory]",
    "修复[灯身·勇气赐福]1次": "Light up 1 node(s) of [Lantern Frame: Blessing of Courage]",
    "修复[灯身·勇气赐福]24次": "Light up 24 node(s) of [Lantern Frame: Blessing of Courage]",
    "修复[灯座·正义赐福]1次": "Light up1 node(s) of [Lantern Base: Blessing of Justice]",
    "修复[灯座·正义赐福]24次": "Light up24 node(s) of [Lantern Base: Blessing of Justice]",
    "修复[提手·光明赐福]1次": "Light up 1 node(s) of [Lantern Handle: Blessing of Light]",
    "修复[提手·光明赐福]24次": "Light up 24 node(s) of [Lantern Handle: Blessing of Light]",
    修复提灯1次: "Light up the Lantern of Mystic Maze 1 time(s)",
    修普诺斯之家: "The Hypnos' House",
    "修世人之罅隙，复上古之敦睦。": "To mend the rift among men, and restore the concord of elder days.",
    "咻——嘎！！！": "Whoosh—! Quack!!!",
    "秀芳！你终于来见我了！不要改嫁好不好，我才是唯一对你好的人啊！": "Xiufang! You came... you finally came! Don't... don't marry him, alright? Don't leave me... please... I'm the only one who's ever loved you with all my heart...",
    "秀芳……不要离开我……秀芳……": "Xiufang... don't leave me... Xiufang...",
    "秀芳……你不知道我这段时日有多想你，你为何……为何不愿见我！": "Xiufang... you've no idea how much I've missed you... Why — why won't you see me?",
    "秀芳……我答应你，再不喝了，我们……": "Xiufang... I swear — I'll stop drinking. I will. We can... we can start over...",
    袖珍旅伴的干粮: "Pocket Companion's Snack",
    袖珍人偶: "Pocket Doll",
    锈痕匕首: "Rust-Etched Dagger",
    "锈迹斑斑的匕首，精致的纹样彰显着主人曾经的高贵，不知属于古战场的哪一抹幽魂。": "A dagger mottled with rust, its elegant engravings a testament to its owner's nobility; perhaps a personal possession of a soul fallen on ancient battlefields.",
    "嗅嗅……嗅嗅……嗯……": "Sniff, sniff... mm...",
    嗅盐: "Activated Sal Volatile",
    嗅盐·二: "Sal Volatile Ⅱ",
    嗅盐·一: "Sal Volatile Ⅰ",
    虚晃一枪: "Bluff & Bluster",
    虚弱的男人: "The Feeble Man",
    虚弱的男子: "Feeble Man",
    "虚弱的呻吟声从低处传来，你注意到一位瘦骨嶙峋的男人倒在篝火边，看起来似乎饿坏了。": "Feeble moans rise from the ground. You spot a skeleton of a man collapsing near the firepit, his hollow cheeks speaking of starvation.",
    虚实之兔: "Dream-Bound Bunnies",
    虚妄献祭: "Illusionary Sacrifice",
    虚无·极昼: "Nihility·Midnight Sun",
    虚无·决断: "Nihility·Volition",
    虚无·燎原: "Nihility·Wildfire",
    "嘘——我可什么都没有说哦。": "Shh. I never said that.",
    "嘘，不要窥探面纱之下的秘密。": "Shh... Best not look beneath the veil.",
    "嘘！乐园庆典启幕": "Shh! The Parade Begins",
    "嘘！它的声音模糊不清……我一直没办法听清楚，只要再给我一点时间，再给我……": "Hush... its voice... so faint... I can't quite catch it. Just a bit more time... just a little more...",
    "嘘……！我在你的家里发现了一种从没见过的神奇虫子，快看，就在那个缝隙里！": "Shh...! There's an amazing little bug in your house. I've never seen one like it before. Look, it went into that crack!",
    "嘘……别喊别喊，我之后还要在这一带骗……不是，跟其他人做生意呢。这些东西给你，行行好别喊了。": "Shhh! Keep it down, will you? I've got other... business opportunities around here. Look — take this, yeah? And let's just pretend this never happened.",
    "嘘……不要惊扰了它们。": "Hush... you'll disturb the gentle flutter of their wings.",
    "嘘……小点声，有人来了。": "Shh. Keep it down. Someone's coming.",
    "嘘嘘嘘，这可是拾荒者的最高机密！要不是你帮我抓过贼，才不会轻易透露给你呢！": "Shhhh! That's a scavenger's top secret! I wouldn't have let you in on it if you hadn't helped me out with that thief!",
    "嘘嘘嘘！小声点！团长不是不让互相说参团费用嘛！当时去报名的时候我也不信，那个自称团长的小姑娘却拍着胸脯跟我们保证，说肯定不会骗咱们的。": "Shush! Keep it down! You know the guide said not to discuss fees. I didn't buy it either at first, but that young lass swore down she wasn't having us on.",
    "需要，我非常需要一个人替我上工，不花钱的那种！唉……可惜根本没有这种好事！": "Desperately! Ideally, someone to cover my shift — for free. But hey, when does that ever happen?",
    "需要！我需要你狠狠咬几口这些麻烦的客人，还要朝他们丢一大堆雪球！让他们以后别在这么难找的地方叫人送菜了。": "YES! I need you to punch those customers — real hard! And chuck a whole blizzard of snowballs at them! Maybe then they'll stop ordering food from the middle of nowhere!",
    "需要！这下面全是秽兽我过不去，你帮我把这份吃的送过去吧。": "YES! The whole place is crawling with Filthoids — I can't get through. Take this meal and deliver it for me, would you?",
    "需要帮忙吗？": "Need a hand?",
    "需要帮助？唔，虽然的确需要帮助，但阁下看起来……并非华胥人士呀。": "Troubling me? Well, I'm in a spot of bother, alright. But looking at you... you ain't exactly a local, are you?",
    "需要我们先帮你问问泽生阁的医师们看看吗？": "Shall we have the healers from Zesheng Pharmacy examine her before we proceed?",
    "需要用一种专门的器材，我们叫它芬氲测量仪，那种东西小巧的很，大概只有两枚铜钱大？": "With a specialised device known as an incense gauge. It's very small — about the size of two copper coins.",
    徐泓: "Xu Hong",
    许安: "Xu An",
    "许多第一天加入山外山的新人会被老成员告知：“如果今日活做完了，不如去演武场看看。”\n最初演武场只是为了方便飘零人们切磋武艺而设置，但久而久之，渐渐发展出一些其他的用途。": "Most fresh faces in Outer Peaks get told the same thing on their first day: \"Done with your errands? Go take a look at the training yard.\"\nIt was originally set up so the Drifters could spar and hone their craft, but over time, it has picked up a few... additional uses.",
    "许多屋子托匠矩阁的师傅们来翻新过，所以看起来确实相差不大。但毕竟年份和材质摆在那儿，多少都会出些问题。": "Quite a few of them have been fixed up by the craftsmen at the Hall of Craft, so they look sound enough from the outside. But the structure's still old, and sooner or later problems will start to show.",
    许星垂: "Xu Xingchui",
    序章: "Prologue",
