    "严格按照图纸打造的销骨部件。由钢铁打造，足够坚硬。当子弹打空，也是一件趁手的钝器或投掷物。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Osteobreaker. Sturdy and robust, it doubles effectively as a blunt instrument or a throwable weapon when out of bullets.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的销骨部件。子弹从这里倾泄而出，每到此时，枪管与战士的心同样滚烫。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Osteobreaker. Bullets burst forth from here, as both the barrel and the warrior's heart blaze with unrelenting fervour.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的茵布拉花序部件。和谐的弧度彰显着其出色的抗压抗弯能力，使力的传递变得更加集中而高效。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Embla Inflorescence. The graceful curve not only withstands immense stress but also enhances the bow's resilience, ensuring efficient and precise energy transfer.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的茵布拉花序部件。强大的回弹力让它仿佛一个蓄势待发的弹簧，稍一触碰，便会将积压的一切发射出去。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Embla Inflorescence. Like a tightly coiled spring, a mere touch on the string is enough to unleash a torrent of pent-up energy.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的茵布拉花序部件。强度与刚度兼备，精准与力量俱佳。它如经验丰富的舵手般，准确地校准着离弦的轨迹。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Embla Inflorescence. With an ideal blend of rigidity and flexibility, it balances precision and strength, steering each arrow with the accuracy of a seasoned navigator, calibrating its trajectory.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的银白敕令部件。一旦扣下扳机，子弹就不会回头——就如同人下定决心的那一瞬。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Silverwhite Edict. There is no turning back once the trigger is pulled, much like the commitment that seals a decisive moment.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的银白敕令部件。由钢铁打造，足够坚硬。当子弹打空，也是一件趁手的钝器或投掷物。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Silverwhite Edict. Sturdy and robust, it doubles effectively as a blunt instrument or a throwable weapon when out of bullets.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的银白敕令部件。子弹从这里倾泄而出，每到此时，枪管与战士的心同样滚烫。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Silverwhite Edict. Bullets burst forth from here, as both the barrel and the warrior's heart blaze with unrelenting fervour.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的引浪小调部件。一旦扣下扳机，子弹就不会回头——就如同人下定决心的那一瞬。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Submerged Serenade. There is no turning back once the trigger is pulled, much like the commitment that seals a decisive moment.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的引浪小调部件。由钢铁打造，足够坚硬。当子弹打空，也是一件趁手的钝器或投掷物。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Submerged Serenade. Sturdy and robust, it doubles effectively as a blunt instrument or a throwable weapon when out of bullets.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的引浪小调部件。子弹从这里倾泄而出，每到此时，枪管与战士的心同样滚烫。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Submerged Serenade. Bullets burst forth from here, as both the barrel and the warrior's heart blaze with unrelenting fervour.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的幽鲨眼部件。冷兵器上最贴近使用者的部分，“趁手”，是它最实际的设计目的。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Fathomless Sharkgaze. As the part closest to the wielder, the essence of its design is to ensure optimal \"handiness.\"",
    "严格按照图纸打造的幽鲨眼部件。无论刀刃是曲是直，是轻是重，它的锋芒都只为战斗而生。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Fathomless Sharkgaze. Whether the blade is curved or straight, light or heavy, its edge is honed exclusively for battle.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的泽世的慈雨部件。冷兵器上最贴近使用者的部分，“趁手”，是它最实际的设计目的。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Halcyon Gracefall. As the component closest to the wielder, the essence of its design is to ensure optimal handling.",
