    "严格按照图纸打造的织梦的白羽部件。一旦扣下扳机，子弹就不会回头——就如同人下定决心的那一瞬。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Dreamweaver's Feather. There is no turning back once the trigger is pulled, much like the commitment that seals a decisive moment.",
