    "严格按照图纸打造的织梦的白羽部件。子弹从这里倾泄而出，每到此时，枪管与战士的心同样滚烫。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Dreamweaver's Feather. Bullets burst forth from here, as both the barrel and the warrior's heart blaze with unrelenting fervour.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的中级武器部件。充分贯彻了使用者的意志，而唯有强大，才有资格在战场上彰显这份独一无二的个性。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of an intermediate weapon component. It embodies the wielder's will — only the strong are entitled to showcase their unique individuality on the battlefield.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的中级武器部件。冷兵器上最贴近使用者的部分，“趁手”，是它最实际的设计目的。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of an intermediate weapon component. As the component closest to the wielder, the essence of its design is to ensure optimal handling.",
