    "严格按照图纸打造的中级武器部件。子弹从这里倾泄而出，每到此时，枪管与战士的心同样滚烫。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of an intermediate weapon component. Bullets burst forth from here, as both the barrel and the warrior's heart blaze with unrelenting fervour.",
