    "严格按照图纸打造的锥心黑曜镰部件。冷兵器上最贴近使用者的部分，“趁手”，是它最实际的设计目的。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Obsidian Heart-Reaper. As the component closest to the wielder, the essence of its design is to ensure optimal handling.",
