    "严格按照图纸打造的赘生部件。由钢铁打造，足够坚硬。当子弹打空，也是一件趁手的钝器或投掷物。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Excresduo. Sturdy and robust, it doubles effectively as a blunt instrument or a throwable weapon when out of bullets.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的赘生部件。子弹从这里倾泄而出，每到此时，枪管与战士的心同样滚烫。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of Excresduo. Bullets burst forth from here, as both the barrel and the warrior's heart blaze with unrelenting fervour.",
    "严格按照图纸打造的最好的一天部件。由钢铁打造，足够坚硬。当子弹打空，也是一件趁手的钝器或投掷物。": "Crafted with precision from the blueprint of The Best Day. Sturdy and robust, it doubles effectively as a blunt instrument or a throwable weapon when out of bullets.",
