    "吟游诗人？这名儿倒是新鲜。不过我可不是什么诗人，我是个种地的。喏，这一大片都是我家的田地。": "A wandering bard? That's a new one. No, nothing like that — I'm just a farmer. Look — this whole stretch is my family's land.",
