    "银烛狂欢节在一连串意外中结束后，冰湖城又笼罩了一层阴云。\n在这个不大不小的危急时刻，那位自称光之魔王的皎皎站了出来！": "The Silvercandle Carnival wrapped up in a chain of unexpected twists, casting yet another shadow over Icelake.\nIn this moment of uncertainty, the self-proclaimed \"Demon King of Light\" burst onto the scene!",
