    "鱼来，鱼来。": "Come, fish. Come.",
    "鱼我所欲也，熊掌亦我所欲也，二者不可得兼，无鱼上钩遂取熊掌者也。\n\n——某磨刀霍霍的钓鱼高手": "Fish I desire, and bear paws I desire too. But if both can't be had — well, if no fish will bite, I'll take the paws.\n\n— A veteran angler sharpening his knife",
