    "与你曾有一面之缘的华胥商人止流近期停留在水仙平原。你作为出色的狩月人，被推荐帮她完成筹备工作。为止流收集材料，换取丰厚的报酬吧。": "The merchant Zhiliu from Huaxu, whom you crossed paths with before, has settled briefly in The Asphodel. As a proven Phoxhunter, you've been recommended to help her get ready. Gather what she needs and earn generous rewards.",
    "与你无关。": "That's none of your business.",
    "与其把时间沉溺在幻想之中，还是脚踏实地地去追寻一些看得见摸得着的东西吧。": "Instead of drowning in daydreams, you'd be better off chasing something tangible. Something flesh and blood.",
    "与其冒可能落得糟糕口碑的风险，还是让故事平稳落地会更好吧？": "Instead of risking a public outcry and bad reviews, surely it's wiser to bring the story in for a safe landing?",
