    "雨蛙戏是练习腿部，毕竟观雨蛙弹跳力惊人嘛，咱们老了虽然不用像年轻人一样爬高下低，但是还是难免要出门走走，活动活动。": "The Rainseer Frog form works the legs. Have you seen how they leap? We may be old, but we still need to get about now and then, even if we're no longer as spry as the youngsters.",
