    御箓生: "Talisman-Wielding Wishen",
    "遇害的那位是一名学堂的孩子，因为家境好，父母疏于管教又溺爱，导致性格十分恶劣，在学堂里一直有小霸王之称。": "The victim was a schoolboy. Wealthy family, spoiled rotten, and never taught any manners. He was a nasty piece of work, a proper little tyrant in the schoolyard.",
    煜明: "Yuming",
    煜明的: "Yuming's",
    煜明的衣饰: "Yuming's Accessory",
    蜮: "Yuu",
    蜮·异种: "Yuu Variant",
    "冤情难解，尤其是她四处走访得知自己的孩子生前遭遇，更是哭瞎了眼。只能到处拜托近亲远邻，求他们还自己一个公道。": "The injustice consumed her. When she found out how her son had been treated, she cried herself blind. She went door to door, begging neighbours and relatives to help her find justice.",
