    铸造灾厄武器·三: "Forge Calamity Weapon Ⅲ",
    铸造灾厄武器·一: "Forge Calamity Weapon Ⅰ",
    "抓紧犁完这片田，就能早些回去歇息了……": "Just this last bit to plough... then I can get home and put my feet up.",
    抓住打打打打打劫皎皎: "Catch Lulu Lunoloot",
    "专供异国友人的纪念品摊铺，来华胥之游人必不可错过！香囊折扇古玩珍宝，您想要的，应有尽有！": "Souvenirs for travellers! First time in Huaxu? Don't pass me by — sachets, folding fans, curios, trinkets, all the little treasures you could want!",
    专家鱼竿: "Expert Rod",
    专业对口: "Right on Target",
    专业物流: "Certified Logistician",
    专注: "Focus",
    专注·厚重: "Focus·Mass",
    专注·威压: "Focus·Coercion",
    专注·迅捷: "Focus – Celerity",
    专注的男子: "Man Lost in Thought",
    专注符石: "Rune: Focus",
    "转啊转啊，回忆如灯上走马。": "As the carousel of time spins, echoes ride phantom steeds.",
    "转到了新岗位，又能收集到新的了！真开心，今天晚上回去加餐！": "Just got transferred to a new post — that means a new one for the collection! Heh-heh. I'm celebrating this with a proper dinner tonight.",
    "转到了新岗位，又能收集到新的了。": "Just got transferred to a new post — that means a new one for the collection!",
    转动螺旋: "Spinning Helix",
