    转雷符石: "Rune: Thunderstorm",
    庄家: "Dealer",
    装备精良的士兵: "Well-Equipped Soldier",
    "装备专用的喷涂装置，可以用来均匀涂装防锈药剂以延长装备的耐久性，部分武器可以通过该装置提升性能。如果与血清注射剂弄混会产生严重的后果，请务必谨慎使用。": "A specialized spraying device for equipment, used to uniformly apply rust-proofing agents to extend the durability of equipment, and increase the performance of some weapons. Mixing it up with serum injectors can have severe consequences, so it must be used with caution.",
    装订凭证: "Badge of Compilation",
    "装满子弹的补给箱，战场上的生命之源与死亡尽头。": "A supply chest brimming with bullets, which both saves and ends lives on the battlefield.",
    "装饰品上的点点星光，铭刻着美与闪耀的瞬间。": "A glint of starlight on a trinket, capturing a fleeting moment of brilliance.",
    装饰组合礼箱·财源: "Accessory Collection Chest – Affluence",
    装填: "Reload Speed",
    "装填后，攻击速度提高#1，持续#2秒。": "After reloading, increases ATK Speed by #1 for #2s.",
    "装着时间与回忆的沙漏。无数华彩闪熠其间，万千光阴以此见证。": "An hourglass captures not just sand, but the passage of time and cherished memories. It bears witness to a multitude of splendors and countless stories.",
    壮实: "Beefy",
    壮业: "Zhuang Ye",
    追缉: "Capture",
    追缉·一: "Capture (Ⅰ)",
    追加伤害: "Additional DMG",
    追加伤害倍率: "Additional DMG",
