    追猎·鎏金: "Hunt: Gilt",
    追猎·晴蓝: "Hunt: Celeste",
    追猎·绣红: "Hunt: Rust Red",
    "追梦？": "A dream?",
    "追随灾厄的脚步，寻觅倾覆世界的力量，以罗盘指引前进的方向。\n可用于进入深境委托。": "Follow in Calamity's wake, seek the power to overturn the world, and let the compass lead you onward.\nCan be used to enter Abyssal Commissions.",
    追袭: "Huntdown",
