    赘生的枪身: "Excresduo: Frame",
    "准备好了，芬氲测量仪也从匠矩阁借来，分发给今日值勤的香官们。": "Everything is in place. We've also collected the incense gauges from the Hall of Craft and issued them to today's incense wardens.",
    捉迷藏: "Hide and Seek",
    "捉迷藏，捉迷藏，一起来玩捉迷藏！": "Hide and seek! Come and play hide and seek!",
    "桌子……擦过了。地板……也擦过了。还剩……扶手，对，还有扶手。": "Table... done. Floor... done. What's left... the handrail. Yes, the handrail.",
    灼热地狱: "Raging Inferno",
    "灼伤之前可能是压伤。": "More likely crushed before you ever get burned.",
