    子弹伤害: "Projectile DMG",
    "子弹装填速度+#1。装填子弹后，攻击速度提高#2，持续6.0秒。切换至其他武器时，失去效果。": "Reload Speed +#1. After reloading, ATK Speed increases by #2 for 6.0s. This effect is removed when switching weapons.",
    "仔细一看……你的白发没有一丝瑕疵，像是雪一样纯粹呢，真漂亮……你这应该不是染的吧？": "Now that I look properly... your hair really is perfect. Pure white, just like snow. It's beautiful... You didn't dye it, did you?",
    紫: "Purple",
    紫晶艾尔芙: "Electrelf",
    紫露花: "Dewiolet",
    "紫陌飞尘，雕鞍绣毂。": "Dust rises along the capital road, veiling gilded reins and ornate carriages.",
    紫陌红尘: "Dust on the Capital Road",
