    最速传说·终结技Ⅲ: "Legendary Blitz: Ultimate Skill Ⅲ",
    "最细微的湿度变化也逃不过月舞狐尾巴的感知，老道的旅者常用月舞狐是否在雨夜独舞，来判断阴云何时将要散去，月光何时将会重归。": "The most subtle changes in humidity can not escape the perception of a phoxfox tail. Sophisticated travelers often observe whether a phoxfox in a rainy night would solo dance or not, thus to determine when the clouds will be dispersed, and when the moonlight will return.",
    "最一开始，人们试图从月石中分离出黄金，但后来，人们发现这枚小小的石头还有更多用途——转动机械的齿轮，释放电的火花……它就是索拉之民的“魔法”。": "At first, its purpose was simple: to extract gold from Phoxene. But over time, we discovered this tiny crystal could do so much more — power machinery, generate electricity... It's Solarian magic.",
    "最早的千星板是只有导航的作用，但随着织星客们后续对千星板的不断改进，现在的千星板也多了一些功能。": "Its earliest use was navigation. Later, the Starweavers refined their craft, adding new functions.",
    "最终，你意识到了，无论生时如何，现在的你已经无法再与一切产生纠葛，那种内心的平静，就如同白木的寂寥感一样，回味无穷……": "And then, at last, you understand. Whatever ties once bound you in life can hold you no longer. What remains is a quiet stillness — the same lonely calm that lingers in Ivorywood long after the rest of the fragrance has faded.",
    "最终，我的故事化作一段坊间流传的佳话，谁人不道皓京有一位痴情男儿，为异国的白衣过客肝肠寸断！": "And finally, my tale becomes legend! All of Haojing will speak of the devoted lover, heartbroken over the mysterious stranger in white!",
    "罪恶不需要温室的滋养，便能在人心中悄然盛开。": "Sin needs no hothouse. It blooms in silence, deep within the human heart.",
