    "尊敬的{性别：先生|女士}，请等一下。您能否差遣您的随身仆人，为我们办件事？": "Excuse me, {性别：sir|madam}. Could I trouble you for a moment? Would you mind sending one of your attendants to help us?",
    "尊敬的{性别：先生|女士}，宣传员开心麦克雷很荣幸为您服务！": "Why, certainly, {性别：sir|madam}! Cheery McRae, at your service. It would be a pleasure to show you around!",
