    昨日匆匆: "Fleeting Traces",
    昨日重现: "Yesterday Once More",
    "昨天到港的北风莓酱，怎么现在还没通过检查！快把货给我！": "The Borealberry jam that came in yesterday — why is it still held up in inspection? I need my goods, and I need them now!",
    "昨天睡得好吗？": "Did you have a good night's sleep?",
    "昨天太倒霉了！一分钱没赢，还亏了一瓶酒，哎！我跟你说，我今天手气特别好，肯定能赢钱。": "Absolute disaster yesterday! Didn't win a single coin, and I even lost enough for a bottle of liquor. Still, I've got a good feeling about today. My luck's in. I'm definitely winning tonight.",
    "昨天我往东边走，看见一片麦子地，黄灿灿的，想蹲下来摸一把，刚伸手就又回来了。": "Yesterday I walked east. Saw a field of wheat, all gold. I crouched to touch a handful — but the moment I reached out, I was back here again.",
    "昨夜通宵整理典籍，今日双眼昏花，恐一蹬腿就要去往虞泉了！": "I was up all night poring over the old texts. My eyes are shot... at this rate, I'll be at the Spring of Yu before long.",
