    "坐在火车上，手里端一杯咖啡，品鉴之余还能看看窗外的风景，这多是一件美事啊。": "A good seat, a hot cup of coffee, and the scenery drifting past the window... honestly, there's nothing quite like it.",
    "做工确实精良，就这么裂开了真是可惜。": "Such a beautifully crafted watch. It's a pity it cracked like that.",
    "做魔灵学者的感觉如何？": "How's life as a Geniemon scholar?",
    "做人最要紧的当然是自己开心。": "Values spontaneity and personal freedom over order.",
    "做什么？": "What is it?",
    "做生意的人多了，大家日子也会逐渐好起来，就不会什么人想着要造反了。": "And if more people can make a decent living, things will get better little by little. Then maybe there won't be so many people wanting to rise up against the Empire.",
