    异化夜魔之叠影: "de Lilith occulteÉchombre",
    异化夜魔之锋锐: "de Lilith occulteTranchant",
    异化夜魔之攻势: "de Lilith occulteFulgurance",
    异化夜魔之盛怒: "de Lilith occulteFureur",
    异化夜魔之透析: "de Lilith occultePénétration",
    异化夜魔之迅捷: "de Lilith occulteCélérité",
